#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:4
msgid "Migrating To 3.0"
msgstr "迁移到 3.0"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:8
msgid ""
"Choose the path that matches the code you are starting from. The Isaac Lab "
"2.x path is organized in the order most projects should migrate: install the"
" new release, configure a backend, update task APIs, then move training and "
"visualization workflows."
msgstr ""
"请按现有代码的来源选择迁移路径。Isaac Lab 2.x 路径按照大多数项目应采用的顺序组织：安装新版本、配置后端、更新任务 "
"API，再迁移训练和可视化工作流。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:12
msgid "**Choose your starting point:**"
msgstr "**选择起点：**"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:14
msgid ""
":ref:`Migration from Isaac Lab 2.x to 3.0 <migrating-from-isaaclab-2-x>` -- "
"update an existing Isaac Lab project for the new installation, APIs, and "
"multi-backend architecture."
msgstr ""
":ref:`从 Isaac Lab 2.x 迁移到 3.0 <migrating-from-isaaclab-2-x>` ：为现有 Isaac Lab "
"项目更新安装方式、API 和多后端架构。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:16
msgid ""
":ref:`Migration from Isaac Gym and IsaacGymEnvs <migrating-from-"
"isaacgymenvs>` -- port an Isaac Gym task, simulation configuration, or "
"training workflow to Isaac Lab."
msgstr ""
":ref:`从 Isaac Gym 和 IsaacGymEnvs 迁移 <migrating-from-isaacgymenvs>` ：将 Isaac "
"Gym 任务、仿真配置或训练工作流移植到 Isaac Lab。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:18
msgid ""
":ref:`Migration of deformables <migrating-deformables>` -- move from the old"
" soft-body API to surface and volume deformables."
msgstr ":ref:`可变形物体迁移 <migrating-deformables>` ：从旧软体 API 迁移到表面及体积可变形物体。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:25
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本页内容"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:30
msgid "Migration from Isaac Lab 2.x to 3.0"
msgstr "从 Isaac Lab 2.x 迁移到 3.0"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:31
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab 3.0 separates backend-specific simulation code from the core API "
"and introduces unified commands for common workflows. Work through the "
"following sections in order; skip a section only when your project does not "
"use that feature."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 3.0 将后端专用仿真代码与核心 API "
"分离，并为常见工作流提供统一命令。请按顺序完成以下各节；只有项目未使用某项功能时，才跳过对应章节。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:37
msgid ""
"This part of the page is the source of truth for the ``isaaclab-"
"migrating-2x-to-3x`` agent skill (`skills/user/migrate-2x-to-3x/ "
"<../../../skills/user/migrate-2x-to-3x/SKILL.md>`__). When you change it, "
"update the skill so agent guidance stays in sync. See "
":doc:`/source/developer-tools/agent_skills`."
msgstr ""
"本页这一部分是 ``isaaclab-migrating-2x-to-3x`` 智能体技能（ "
"`skills/user/migrate-2x-to-3x/ "
"<../../../skills/user/migrate-2x-to-3x/SKILL.md>`__ "
"）的权威依据。修改时应同步更新技能，使智能体的指导保持一致。见 :doc:`/source/developer-tools/agent_skills` "
"。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:44
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:46
msgid ""
"Start from a fresh Isaac Lab 3.0 checkout and Python 3.12 environment "
"instead of upgrading the packages inside an existing 2.x environment. The "
"recommended workflow now uses ``uv`` to resolve the project environment and "
"optional integrations when a command runs. The ``isaaclab.sh`` installer is "
"still available for manually managed environments, but it is no longer the "
"default path."
msgstr ""
"请使用全新的 Isaac Lab 3.0 仓库和 Python 3.12 环境，不要在现有 2.x 环境内升级软件包。现在推荐通过 ``uv`` "
"在命令运行时解析项目环境及可选集成。 ``isaaclab.sh`` 安装器仍可用于手动管理的环境，但已不再是默认方式。"

