msgid "Isaac Lab 3.0"
msgstr "Isaac Lab 3.0"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:68
msgid ""
"Install ``uv`` once; ``uv run`` creates or synchronizes the project "
"environment and launches the unified command. Select optional runtimes with "
"``--extra`` before ``isaaclab``."
msgstr ""
"安装一次 ``uv`` ； ``uv run`` 会创建或同步项目环境，再启动统一命令。在 ``isaaclab`` 之前使用 ``--extra`` "
"选择可选运行时。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:78
msgid ""
"Use ``uv run isaaclab ...`` for Newton-only workflows, ``--extra ovphysx`` "
"for OV PhysX, and ``--extra isaacsim`` for full Isaac Sim support. See "
":ref:`installation-method-uv` for platform-specific setup, the complete "
"extras list, and manually managed environment options."
msgstr ""
"仅使用 Newton 的工作流采用 ``uv run isaaclab ...`` ，OV PhysX 添加 ``--extra ovphysx`` "
"，完整 Isaac Sim 支持添加 ``--extra isaacsim`` 。平台专用配置、完整额外依赖列表及手动管理环境的选项，见 "
":ref:`installation-method-uv` 。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:84
msgid "Multi-Backend Architecture and Presets"
msgstr "多后端架构与预设"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:86
msgid ""
"Understand the new package boundaries first, then make environment "
"configuration backend-selectable."
msgstr "先了解新的包边界，再让环境配置支持选择后端。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:93
msgid ""
"Physics-specific configuration and implementations were exposed through the "
"core package, and environments typically configured one PhysX backend "
"directly."
msgstr "物理专用配置及实现通过核心包提供，环境通常直接配置单个 PhysX 后端。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:104
msgid ""
"Core assets dispatch to the selected backend. Import backend-owned "
"configuration explicitly and use a preset when an environment supports "
"multiple backends."
msgstr "核心资产分派到所选后端。显式导入后端专有配置，环境支持多个后端时采用预设。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:122
msgid "Multi-Backend Architecture"
msgstr "多后端架构"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:123
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab 3.0 introduces a **factory-based multi-backend architecture** that"
" allows asset classes to be backed by different physics engines — currently "
"**PhysX** and **Newton**."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 3.0 引入 **基于工厂的多后端架构** ，让资产类能够使用不同物理引擎，目前支持 **PhysX** 和 **Newton** "
"。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:126
msgid ""
"When you instantiate an asset class from the ``isaaclab`` package (e.g., "
"``Articulation``, ``RigidObject``), a factory automatically resolves and "
"loads the correct backend implementation:"
msgstr ""
"实例化 ``isaaclab`` 包中的资产类（如 ``Articulation`` 、 ``RigidObject`` "
"）时，工厂会自动确定并加载正确的后端实现："

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:137
msgid ""
"The factory works by convention: for a class defined in "
"``isaaclab.assets.articulation``, it imports the matching class from the "
"active backend package. The ``isaaclab_physx``, ``isaaclab_newton``, and "
"``isaaclab_ov`` packages mirror the ``isaaclab`` module structure."
msgstr ""
"工厂按约定工作：对于定义在 ``isaaclab.assets.articulation`` 中的类，会从当前后端包导入对应类。 "
"``isaaclab_physx`` 、 ``isaaclab_newton`` 和 ``isaaclab_ov`` 的模块结构与 "
"``isaaclab`` 对应。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:141
msgid ""
"The concrete default remains task-specific so launching without an override "
"stays predictable. Tasks can expose alternatives such as ``physics=physx``, "
"``physics=ovphysx``, or ``physics=newton_mjwarp`` without changing their "
"asset import paths."
msgstr ""
"具体默认值仍由任务决定，确保不指定覆盖设置时的启动行为可预测。任务可提供 ``physics=physx`` 、 ``physics=ovphysx``"
" 或 ``physics=newton_mjwarp`` 等选项，无需改变资产导入路径。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:145
msgid ""
"For a comprehensive overview of the factory pattern and backend selection, "
"see :doc:`/source/concepts/backend_architecture`. To add a new backend, see "
":doc:`/source/developer-tools/add_physics_backend`."
msgstr ""
"工厂模式与后端选择的完整介绍，见 :doc:`/source/concepts/backend_architecture` 。添加新后端的方法，见 "
":doc:`/source/developer-tools/add_physics_backend` 。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:151
msgid "New ``isaaclab_physx`` and ``isaaclab_newton`` Extensions"
msgstr "新增 ``isaaclab_physx`` 和 ``isaaclab_newton`` 扩展"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:152
msgid "Two new backend extensions have been introduced:"
msgstr "引入了两个新的后端扩展："

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:154
msgid ""
"**``isaaclab_physx``** — PhysX-specific implementations of asset and sensor "
"classes."
msgstr "``isaaclab_physx`` ：资产及传感器类的 PhysX 专用实现。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:155
msgid ""
"**``isaaclab_newton``** — Newton-specific implementations of supported asset"
" classes, including articulations, rigid objects, and deformable objects."
msgstr "``isaaclab_newton`` ：受支持资产类的 Newton 专用实现，包括关节体、刚性物体和可变形物体。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:158
msgid "The following classes have been moved to ``isaaclab_physx``:"
msgstr "以下类已移至 ``isaaclab_physx`` ："

