#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:173
msgid ""
"Deformable object public APIs remain in the backend-neutral ``isaaclab`` "
"package. Continue importing :class:`~isaaclab.assets.DeformableObject`, "
":class:`~isaaclab.assets.DeformableObjectCfg`, and "
":class:`~isaaclab.assets.DeformableObjectData` from ``isaaclab.assets``."
msgstr ""
"可变形物体的公共 API 仍保留在后端中立的 ``isaaclab`` 包中。继续从 ``isaaclab.assets`` 导入 "
":class:`~isaaclab.assets.DeformableObject` 、 "
":class:`~isaaclab.assets.DeformableObjectCfg` 和 "
":class:`~isaaclab.assets.DeformableObjectData` 。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:180
msgid ""
"The ``isaaclab_physx`` extension is installed automatically with Isaac Lab. "
