msgid ""
"These sensor classes now use factory patterns that automatically instantiate"
" the appropriate backend implementation (PhysX by default), maintaining full"
" backward compatibility."
msgstr "这些传感器类现在采用工厂模式，自动实例化相应后端实现（默认为 PhysX），仍完全向后兼容。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:208
msgid ""
"The ``Imu`` sensor in Isaac Lab 3.0 is **not** the same as the ``Imu`` "
"sensor in 2.x. The old ``Imu`` (full state sensor) has been renamed to "
":class:`~isaaclab.sensors.Pva`. The new :class:`~isaaclab.sensors.Imu` is a "
"lightweight sensor that only provides angular velocity and linear "
"acceleration. See :ref:`imu-to-pva-migration` below for details."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 3.0 的 ``Imu`` 传感器与 2.x 中的 **不同** 。旧 ``Imu`` （完整状态传感器）已改名为 "
":class:`~isaaclab.sensors.Pva` ；新的 :class:`~isaaclab.sensors.Imu` "
"是轻量级传感器，只提供角速度和线加速度。详见下文 :ref:`imu-to-pva-migration` 。"

