#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:235
msgid ""
"These classes implement the same base interfaces as their PhysX counterparts"
" (:class:`~isaaclab.assets.BaseArticulation`, "
":class:`~isaaclab.assets.BaseRigidObject`), ensuring a consistent API across"
" backends. They use the same warp-based data conventions (``wp.array`` with "
"structured types, ``_index`` / ``_mask`` write methods)."
msgstr ""
