#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:258
msgid ""
"In Isaac Lab 3.0, the spawner schema cfg classes are split into solver-"
"common **base classes** (in ``isaaclab.sim.schemas``) and **backend-specific"
" subclasses** in ``isaaclab_physx.sim.schemas`` and "
"``isaaclab_newton.sim.schemas``. This makes the same asset cfg portable "
"across PhysX and Newton backends, and adds slots for backend-specific asset-"
"level knobs (e.g., MuJoCo gravity compensation)."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 3.0 将生成器的模式配置类拆分为求解器共用的 **基类** （位于 ``isaaclab.sim.schemas`` ），以及位于"
" ``isaaclab_physx.sim.schemas`` 和 ``isaaclab_newton.sim.schemas`` 的 "
"**后端专用子类** 。这样，同一资产配置可跨 PhysX 和 Newton 使用，也为后端专用的资产级参数预留位置，例如 MuJoCo 重力补偿。"

