#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:338
msgid ""
"Two cfg fields were renamed so their snake_case names map identity-style to "
"the USD camelCase attribute names. The old names remain as deprecated "
"dataclass fields on :class:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.JointDriveBaseCfg` (so "
"``dataclasses.fields()`` still sees them) and are forwarded to the new "
"fields in ``__post_init__`` with a ``DeprecationWarning``. Setting **both** "
"the old and new field on the same instance is silent — the canonical (new) "
"field wins; the old field's value is discarded after the warning. Both "
"aliases are scheduled for removal in 4.0."
msgstr ""
"两个配置字段已重命名，使其 snake_case 名称与 USD 的 camelCase 属性名一一对应。旧名仍作为已弃用的 dataclass "
"字段保留在 :class:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.JointDriveBaseCfg` 上，因此 "
"``dataclasses.fields()`` 仍能看到它们； ``__post_init__`` 会将值转发到新字段，并产生 "
"``DeprecationWarning`` 。同一实例中 **同时** 设置新旧字段不会报错，新字段优先；发出警告后旧字段值被丢弃。两个别名均计划在 "
"4.0 移除。"

