#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:411
msgid ""
"**Schema fragments supersede the whole** ``*PropertiesCfg`` / ``*BaseCfg`` "
"**layer**"
msgstr "**模式片段取代整个配置层** （ ``*PropertiesCfg`` / ``*BaseCfg`` ）"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:413
msgid ""
"The split above kept the inheritance-based shape of the 2.x cfgs: one class "
"per backend, each carrying fields from several USD namespaces. Isaac Lab now"
" replaces that layer with **schema fragments** — one ``@configclass`` per "
"USD applied schema, each writing exactly one attribute namespace. A spawner "
"slot takes a *list* of fragments, so you compose the namespaces you actually"
" want instead of picking a class that bundles them."
msgstr ""
"上述拆分保留了 2.x 配置基于继承的形式：每个后端一个类，每个类携带多个 USD 命名空间的字段。Isaac Lab 现在以 **模式片段** "
"替代这一层：每个 USD 应用模式对应一个 ``@configclass`` ，只写入一个属性命名空间。生成器配置字段接受片段 "
"*列表*，因此可以组合实际所需的命名空间，无需选择捆绑多个命名空间的类。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:420
msgid ""
"Every class in the table below is deprecated: instantiating one emits a "
"``DeprecationWarning`` naming its replacement, and the class will be removed"
" in 3.2. Nothing is removed in 3.0 — both APIs work side by side."
msgstr ""
"下表所有类均已弃用：实例化时会产生指出替代类的 ``DeprecationWarning`` ，并将在 3.2 移除。3.0 不移除任何类，两套 API"
" 可同时使用。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:424
msgid ""
"The replacement column lists **every** fragment needed to cover the "
"deprecated class's fields, including the fields it inherits from a legacy "
"base. A legacy class usually bundles more than one USD namespace, so "
"replacing it with only the backend-specific fragment silently drops the "
"inherited properties."
msgstr ""
"替代列列出覆盖弃用类所有字段所需的 **全部** 片段，包括从旧基类继承的字段。旧类通常捆绑多个 USD "
"命名空间，因此只替换为后端专用片段，会悄然丢失继承的属性。"

