#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:492
msgid ""
"PhysX fragments appear in the Newton rows because several universally "
"honored properties have no other USD home today: ``disable_gravity`` is only"
" ``physxRigidBody:disableGravity``, ``max_joint_velocity`` only "
"``physxJoint:maxJointVelocity``, ``contact_offset`` / ``rest_offset`` only "
"``physxCollision:*``, and ``articulation_enabled`` only "
"``physxArticulation:articulationEnabled``. Newton's USD importer reads those"
" attributes, so the fragment that writes them is the PhysX one regardless of"
" which backend consumes it."
msgstr ""
"Newton 行中包含 PhysX 片段，是因为一些通用属性目前只存在于 PhysX 的 USD 命名空间： ``disable_gravity`` "
"只对应 ``physxRigidBody:disableGravity`` ， ``max_joint_velocity`` 只对应 "
"``physxJoint:maxJointVelocity`` ， ``contact_offset`` / ``rest_offset`` 只对应 "
"``physxCollision:*`` ， ``articulation_enabled`` 只对应 "
"``physxArticulation:articulationEnabled`` 。Newton 的 USD "
"导入器会读取这些属性，因此无论使用哪个后端，写入它们的仍是 PhysX 片段。"

