#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:600
msgid "**Silencing the warnings while you migrate**"
msgstr "**迁移期间关闭警告**"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:602
msgid ""
"The warnings are standard ``DeprecationWarning``\\ s. Filter them by "
"*message* while a migration is in progress:"
msgstr "这些警告是标准 ``DeprecationWarning`` 。迁移期间可按 *消息内容* 过滤："

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:620
msgid ""
"Do not filter these with ``module=\"isaaclab.sim.schemas.*\"``. ``module`` "
"is matched against the ``__name__`` of the frame selected by the warning's "
"``stacklevel``, and these warnings deliberately point at *your* call site, "
"so they are attributed to the module that constructed the cfg or called the "
"writer — never ``isaaclab.sim.schemas``. A ``module=`` filter silences "
"nothing here."
msgstr ""
"不要用 ``module=\"isaaclab.sim.schemas.*\"`` 过滤这些警告。 ``module`` 匹配警告的 "
"``stacklevel`` 所选栈帧的 ``__name__`` ；这些警告有意指向 *您的* 调用位置，因此归属于构造配置或调用写入函数的模块，而非"
" ``isaaclab.sim.schemas`` 。这里用 ``module=`` 过滤不会关闭任何警告。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:629
msgid ""
"Spawners auto-enable body-level gravity compensation when joint-level "
"``actuatorgravcomp=True`` is requested but no Mujoco rigid-body cfg is "
"provided — without ``gravcomp`` on the bodies, ``actuatorgravcomp`` is a no-"
"op (no forces to route). To override, pass an explicit "
"``MujocoRigidBodyPropertiesCfg`` in ``rigid_props``. See :ref:`schema-cfgs-"
"gravcomp` for details."
msgstr ""
"请求关节级 ``actuatorgravcomp=True`` 、但未提供 MuJoCo 刚体配置时，生成器会自动启用刚体级重力补偿。没有刚体 "
"``gravcomp`` 时， ``actuatorgravcomp`` 不起作用，因为没有可分配的力。若需覆盖，请在 ``rigid_props`` "
"中显式传入 ``MujocoRigidBodyPropertiesCfg`` 。详见 :ref:`schema-cfgs-gravcomp` 。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:636
