" in USD, see :ref:`schema-cfgs`."
msgstr "各字段所属的类及对应 USD 属性的完整表格，见 :ref:`schema-cfgs` 。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:641
msgid "Multi-Backend Support: PresetCfg Pattern"
msgstr "多后端支持：PresetCfg 模式"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:642
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab 3.0 introduces a **PresetCfg pattern** for writing environment "
"configurations that work with both the PhysX and Newton backends. Instead of"
" hard-coding a single physics config, environments declare named "
"configuration variants. The active variant is selected at launch via a Hydra"
" CLI override."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 3.0 引入 **PresetCfg 模式** ，用于编写同时兼容 PhysX 和 Newton "
"的环境配置。环境声明具名配置变体，而非写死单一物理配置，启动时通过 Hydra 命令行覆盖选择当前变体。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:647
msgid "**What is PresetCfg?**"
msgstr "**什么是 PresetCfg？**"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:649
msgid ""
":class:`~isaaclab_tasks.utils.PresetCfg` is a base ``@configclass`` whose "
"typed fields represent named variants of a configuration section. The field "
"named ``default`` is used when no CLI override is given. Other fields are "
"named presets selectable with ``presets=<name>`` on the command line:"
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaaclab_tasks.utils.PresetCfg` 是基础 ``@configclass`` "
"，其带类型字段代表某一配置部分的具名变体。没有命令行覆盖时，使用 ``default`` 字段。其他字段为命名预设，可通过命令行 "
"``presets=<name>`` 选择："

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:669
msgid "**Selecting a preset at launch**"
msgstr "**启动时选择预设**"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:671
msgid ""
"Pass ``physics=newton_mjwarp`` on the CLI to swap the entire config section."
" Use ``physics=physx`` to opt into automatic PhysX-family selection. The "
"legacy ``presets=NAME`` form still works for the same values."
msgstr ""
"在命令行传入 ``physics=newton_mjwarp`` ，替换整个配置部分。使用 ``physics=physx`` 可启用 PhysX "
"类后端的自动选择。原有的 ``presets=NAME`` 形式仍支持相同取值。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:685
msgid "**Adding Multi-Backend Support to an Environment**"
msgstr "**为环境添加多后端支持**"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:687
msgid "**Step 1 — Physics config**"
msgstr "**步骤 1：物理配置**"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:689
msgid ""
"Replace a plain ``PhysxCfg(...)`` assignment in ``__post_init__`` with a "
"``PresetCfg`` subclass that carries both a PhysX and a Newton variant."
msgstr ""
"将 ``__post_init__`` 中直接赋值的 ``PhysxCfg(...)`` 替换为 ``PresetCfg`` 子类，包含 PhysX 和"
" Newton 两个变体。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:692
msgid "*Before:*"
msgstr "*修改前：*"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:702
msgid ""
"The ``After`` example below mirrors the current Reach task, which "
"intentionally uses Newton/MJWarp as its default. The ``Before`` snippet only"
" illustrates the older single-backend form, so the default differs between "
"the two snippets. When migrating a task that should retain PhysX by default,"
" use ``default: PhysxCfg = isaacsim_physx`` instead. Adding backend variants"
" should not silently change a task's established default."
msgstr ""
"下面的修改后示例对应当前 Reach 任务，它有意将 Newton/MJWarp "
"作为默认后端。修改前的片段仅展示旧单后端形式，因此两个片段的默认值不同。如果迁移的任务应继续默认使用 PhysX，请改为 ``default: "
"PhysxCfg = isaacsim_physx`` 。添加后端变体不应悄然改变任务原有默认值。"

