"**Isaac Sim extension modules must be explicitly enabled before direct "
"import**"
msgstr "**直接导入前必须显式启用 Isaac Sim 扩展**"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:888
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab 3.0 no longer automatically initializes Isaac Sim extensions only "
"to make their Python modules importable. Stock Isaac Lab Kit experiences now"
" load a smaller set of extensions so unused Isaac Sim packages do not pull "
"in unnecessary dependencies or deprecated aliases."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 3.0 不再仅为了让 Python 模块可导入而自动初始化 Isaac Sim 扩展。默认 Kit experience "
"现在加载更少的扩展，避免未使用的 Isaac Sim 包引入不必要的依赖或弃用别名。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:893
msgid ""
"If your project imports an Isaac Sim extension module directly, enable the "
"extension after the Kit application has started and before importing from "
"that module:"
msgstr "如果项目直接导入 Isaac Sim 扩展模块，请在 Kit 应用启动后、导入该模块之前启用扩展："

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:904
msgid ""
"This is especially important for migration replacements such as "
"``isaacsim.core.experimental.*`` and ``isaacsim.sensors.experimental.*``. Do"
" not import ``enable_extension`` from "
"``isaacsim.core.experimental.utils.app`` unless that extension is already "
"enabled; use :func:`isaaclab.sim.utils.enable_extension` from Isaac Lab "
"instead. The helper requires a running Kit application and raises "
"``RuntimeError`` if called from plain Python before Kit is launched."
msgstr ""
"对于 ``isaacsim.core.experimental.*`` 和 ``isaacsim.sensors.experimental.*`` "
"等迁移替代模块，这一点尤其重要。除非对应扩展已经启用，否则不要从 ``isaacsim.core.experimental.utils.app`` 导入"
" ``enable_extension`` ，应使用 Isaac Lab 的 "
":func:`isaaclab.sim.utils.enable_extension` 。该辅助函数要求 Kit 应用已运行；在普通 Python "
"中、Kit 启动前调用会抛出 ``RuntimeError`` 。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:912
msgid "**Kit experience (``.kit``) updates**"
msgstr "**更新 Kit experience 文件** （ ``.kit`` ）"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:914
msgid ""
"If you maintain a custom Kit experience derived from one of the Isaac Lab "
"apps under ``apps/``:"
msgstr "如果维护的是基于 ``apps/`` 下 Isaac Lab 应用的自定义 Kit experience："

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:917
msgid ""
"**Stop registering deprecated extension search paths.** The "
"``extsDeprecated`` search path entry has been removed from all stock Isaac "
"Lab Kit experiences (headless, rendering, XR variants). Mirror that change "
"in your own experience."
msgstr ""
"**停止注册已弃用扩展的搜索路径。** 所有默认 Isaac Lab Kit experience，包括无界面、渲染和 XR 变体，都已移除 "
"``extsDeprecated`` 搜索路径。请在自定义文件中同步修改。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:920
msgid ""
"**Switch explicit Isaac Sim extension dependencies** to the non-deprecated "
"equivalents listed above (``isaacsim.core.experimental.*``, "
"``isaacsim.sensors.experimental.*``, "
"``isaacsim.robot.experimental.wheeled_robots``)."
msgstr ""
"**将显式 Isaac Sim 扩展依赖改为未弃用的对应项** ，即上表的 ``isaacsim.core.experimental.*`` 、 "
"``isaacsim.sensors.experimental.*`` 及 "
"``isaacsim.robot.experimental.wheeled_robots`` 。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:923
msgid ""
"**Do not rely on stock Isaac Lab apps to preload Isaac Sim extensions** that"
" your project imports directly. Either add those extensions to your custom "
"``.kit`` file or enable them with "
":func:`isaaclab.sim.utils.enable_extension` before importing their Python "
"modules."
msgstr ""
"**不要依赖默认 Isaac Lab 应用预加载项目直接导入的 Isaac Sim 扩展。** 请将扩展加入自定义 ``.kit`` 文件，或在导入其 "
"Python 模块之前，通过 :func:`isaaclab.sim.utils.enable_extension` 启用。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:927
msgid ""
"**Remove unused Isaac Sim extensions that pull in** ``isaacsim.core.api`` — "
"Isaac Lab no longer depends on those, and keeping them resurrects the "
"deprecated stack."
msgstr ""
"**移除会引入** ``isaacsim.core.api`` **的未使用扩展** 。Isaac Lab "
"已不再依赖它们，保留它们会重新引入已弃用的组件。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:931
msgid "**``SimulationManager`` is no longer re-exported**"
msgstr "**不再重新导出 SimulationManager**"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:933
msgid ""
"Earlier internal previews of this migration briefly exposed "
"``isaaclab_physx.physics.SimulationManager`` as a public alias of "
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxManager`. **That alias has been "
"removed**; use :class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxManager` directly (with "
"``as SimulationManager`` at the import site if you want backend-agnostic "
"call-site code, as shown above)."
msgstr ""
"本次迁移的早期内部预览曾短暂提供 ``isaaclab_physx.physics.SimulationManager`` ，作为 "
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxManager` 的公共别名。 **该别名已移除** 。请直接使用 "
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxManager` ；如果希望调用代码与后端无关，可如上所示在导入处使用 "
"``as SimulationManager`` 。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:940
msgid "**Retired standalone reproducers**"
msgstr "**已移除的独立复现脚本**"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:942
msgid ""
"A handful of legacy reproducers under ``source/isaaclab/test/deps/isaacsim``"
" that depended on the deprecated Isaac Sim core extensions have been "
"retired: ``check_camera.py``, ``check_floating_base_made_fixed.py``, "
"``check_legged_robot_clone.py``, ``check_rep_texture_randomizer.py``, and "
"``check_ref_count.py``. Use :mod:`isaaclab.sim` together with the new "
"``isaacsim.core.experimental.*`` APIs for the same debugging workflows."
msgstr ""
"``source/isaaclab/test/deps/isaacsim`` 下少量依赖已弃用 Isaac Sim 核心扩展的旧复现脚本已移除，包括 "
"``check_camera.py`` 、 ``check_floating_base_made_fixed.py`` 、 "
"``check_legged_robot_clone.py`` 、 ``check_rep_texture_randomizer.py`` 和 "
"``check_ref_count.py`` 。同类调试工作流请使用 :mod:`isaaclab.sim` ，搭配新的 "
"``isaacsim.core.experimental.*`` API。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:951
msgid "PhysX Tensors API Module Path"
msgstr "PhysX Tensors API 模块路径"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:952
msgid ""
"Recent Isaac Sim releases removed the internal ``impl`` submodule of "
"``omni.physics.tensors`` and now expose the PhysX Tensor API types "
"(``ArticulationView``, ``RigidBodyView``, ``SimulationView``, etc.) directly"
" under ``omni.physics.tensors.api``. Importing from the old path raises "
"``ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'omni.physics.tensors.impl'`` at "
"import time."
msgstr ""
"近期 Isaac Sim 版本移除了 ``omni.physics.tensors`` 的内部 ``impl`` 子模块，现在直接在 "
"``omni.physics.tensors.api`` 下提供 PhysX Tensor API 类型，如 ``ArticulationView`` "
"、 ``RigidBodyView`` 、 ``SimulationView`` 等。从旧路径导入会报 ``ModuleNotFoundError: "
"No module named 'omni.physics.tensors.impl'`` 。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:959
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab has been updated to import from the new path. Downstream code "
"(custom assets, sensors, or scripts) that imported from the old path must be"
" updated:"
msgstr "Isaac Lab 已改用新路径。下游代码，包括自定义资产、传感器或脚本，如果使用旧路径，也必须更新："

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:971
msgid ""
"The class identities are unchanged — only the module path moved. Type hints "
"referencing the old path "
"(``omni.physics.tensors.impl.api.ArticulationView``) should be similarly "
"updated to ``omni.physics.tensors.api.ArticulationView``."
msgstr ""
"类本身不变，仅模块路径迁移。类型提示中的旧路径 ``omni.physics.tensors.impl.api.ArticulationView`` "
"也应改为 ``omni.physics.tensors.api.ArticulationView`` 。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:977
