#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:1072
msgid ""
"``actuator_effort_limit`` clips explicit actuator-model output. "
"``joint_effort_limit`` and ``joint_velocity_limit`` are construction-time "
"joint-property overrides selected by an actuator group's joint expression. "
"The deprecated aliases ``effort_limit``, ``velocity_limit``, "
"``effort_limit_sim``, and ``velocity_limit_sim`` remain accepted in 3.0. "
"``effort_limit`` resolves to the rated ``actuator_effort_limit`` for every "
"actuator type. For an implicit group without a separately configured solver "
"clamp, the rated value also populates ``joint_effort_limit`` for backward "
"compatibility; configure both fields to author distinct rated and solver "
"limits. The runtime ``effort_limit`` and ``velocity_limit`` group properties"
" follow the same mapping and are also deprecated. "
"``actuator_velocity_limit`` describes rated speed or an implicit soft-limit "
"snapshot. ``joint_velocity_limit`` only requests solver enforcement, which "
"is backend-dependent. See :ref:`actuators-joint-property-ownership` for the "
"full ownership model."
msgstr ""
"``actuator_effort_limit`` 裁剪显式执行器模型输出。 ``joint_effort_limit`` 和 "
"``joint_velocity_limit`` 是构造时的关节属性覆盖，通过执行器组的关节表达式选择作用对象。弃用别名 "
"``effort_limit`` 、 ``velocity_limit`` 、 ``effort_limit_sim`` 和 "
"``velocity_limit_sim`` 在 3.0 中仍被接受。所有执行器类型的 ``effort_limit`` 都解析为额定 "
"``actuator_effort_limit`` 。对于未单独配置求解器限幅的隐式组，为保持向后兼容，额定值也会填入 "
"``joint_effort_limit`` ；需要不同的额定和求解器限值时，请同时设置两者。运行时组属性 ``effort_limit`` 和 "
"``velocity_limit`` 采用相同映射，也已弃用。 ``actuator_velocity_limit`` 描述额定速度或隐式软限值快照。 "
"``joint_velocity_limit`` 仅请求求解器施加限制，是否支持取决于后端。完整归属模型见 :ref:`actuators-joint-"
"property-ownership` 。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:1085
msgid ""
"**Behavior change — explicit groups keep the solver effort limit.** Isaac "
"Lab previously raised the solver effort limit to ``1.0e9`` on joints driven "
"by an explicit actuator so that only the model clipped the effort. The "
"solver now keeps the authored or configured ``joint_effort_limit``, so "
"effort submitted by an explicit model is clipped a second time by the "
"solver. If your asset authors a tight joint effort limit and your policy "
"relies on the model limit alone, set ``joint_effort_limit`` at least as "
"large as ``actuator_effort_limit`` in the actuator configuration."
msgstr ""
"**行为变化：显式组保留求解器驱动力限值。** 以前，Isaac Lab 将显式执行器驱动关节的求解器驱动力限值提高到 ``1.0e9`` "
"，只由模型裁剪驱动力。现在求解器保留资产中写入或配置的 ``joint_effort_limit`` "
"，因此显式模型提交的驱动力会被求解器再次裁剪。如果资产设置了较小关节驱动力限值，而策略原本只依赖模型限值，请在执行器配置中将 "
"``joint_effort_limit`` 设为不小于 ``actuator_effort_limit`` 。"

