#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:1431
msgid ""
"The concrete ``root_view`` type is backend-specific. The "
"``get_material_properties()`` call above reads each rigid shape's static "
"friction, dynamic friction, and restitution through the PhysX Tensor API; "
"Newton selections and OvPhysX bindings use different access methods. See "
":doc:`/source/concepts/native-physics-api/index` before using ``root_view`` "
"in backend-portable code."
msgstr ""
"``root_view`` 的具体类型取决于后端。上面的 ``get_material_properties()`` 通过 PhysX Tensor "
"API 读取各刚性形状的静摩擦、动摩擦和恢复系数；Newton 选择及 OvPhysX 绑定使用不同访问方法。在跨后端代码中使用 "
"``root_view`` 前，请参阅 :doc:`/source/concepts/native-physics-api/index` 。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:1440
