"The deformable body API is split by backend and follows the new Omni Physics"
" volume and surface deformable model. See :ref:`migrating-deformables`."
msgstr ""
"可变形体 API 已按后端拆分，并采用新的 Omni Physics 体积与表面可变形模型。见 :ref:`migrating-deformables`"
" 。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:1448
