msgid ""
"Use :class:`~isaaclab.sensors.Pva` / :class:`~isaaclab.sensors.PvaCfg` if "
"you need full state data (pose, linear velocity, angular velocity, linear "
"and angular acceleration, projected gravity)."
msgstr ""
"需要完整状态数据，包括位姿、线速度、角速度、线加速度、角加速度及投影重力时，使用 :class:`~isaaclab.sensors.Pva` / "
":class:`~isaaclab.sensors.PvaCfg` 。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:1458
msgid ""
"Use :class:`~isaaclab.sensors.Imu` / :class:`~isaaclab.sensors.ImuCfg` if "
"you only need angular velocity and linear acceleration (as a real IMU "
"provides)."
msgstr ""
"只需要真实 IMU 提供的角速度和线加速度时，使用 :class:`~isaaclab.sensors.Imu` / "
":class:`~isaaclab.sensors.ImuCfg` 。"

