#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:1548
msgid "Contact force property names"
msgstr "接触力属性名"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:1549
msgid ""
"Contact sensor force properties now state whether they contain aggregate or "
"filtered normal and friction forces. ``net_forces_w`` is the total contact "
"force (normal + friction). Newton reports this quantity directly. PhysX and "
"OVPhysX cannot compute a total force, so they return the corresponding "
"normal-force quantity and warn. ``friction_forces_w`` is the aggregate "
"friction force. Newton reports it as ``net_friction_forces_w``; PhysX and "
"OVPhysX only provide filtered friction, so they return "
"``friction_force_matrix_w`` and warn."
msgstr ""
"接触传感器的力属性现在明确区分汇总量与按对象筛选后的法向力、摩擦力。 ``net_forces_w`` 为总接触力（法向力 + 摩擦力），Newton "
"直接报告该量；PhysX 和 OVPhysX 无法计算总力，因此返回对应法向力量并警告。 ``friction_forces_w`` "
"为汇总摩擦力，Newton 通过 ``net_friction_forces_w`` 报告；PhysX 和 OVPhysX "
"仅提供按对象筛选的摩擦力，因此返回 ``friction_force_matrix_w`` 并警告。"

