"Use :attr:`~isaaclab.sensors.BaseJointWrenchSensor.body_names` or "
":meth:`~isaaclab.sensors.BaseJointWrenchSensor.find_bodies` to map sensor "
"entries to articulation body names. PhysX reports one entry for every link, "
"including the articulation root link. Newton reports the child bodies of "
"reportable incoming joints."
msgstr ""
"使用 :attr:`~isaaclab.sensors.BaseJointWrenchSensor.body_names` 或 "
":meth:`~isaaclab.sensors.BaseJointWrenchSensor.find_bodies` "
"，将传感器条目映射到关节体刚体名称。PhysX 为每个连杆报告一个条目，包括根连杆；Newton 报告可测量的连入关节所对应的子刚体。"

