#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:1665
msgid "Ray Caster Warp Backend"
msgstr "射线投射器 Warp 后端"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:1666
msgid ""
"The :class:`~isaaclab.sensors.RayCaster`, "
":class:`~isaaclab.sensors.RayCasterCamera`, "
":class:`~isaaclab.sensors.MultiMeshRayCaster`, and "
":class:`~isaaclab.sensors.MultiMeshRayCasterCamera` sensors have been "
"transitioned from a PyTorch/USD-based backend to a native Warp kernel "
"pipeline. This improves performance by eliminating per-step tensor "
"allocations and torch-to-warp conversions, but introduces several breaking "
"changes."
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaaclab.sensors.RayCaster` 、 "
":class:`~isaaclab.sensors.RayCasterCamera` 、 "
":class:`~isaaclab.sensors.MultiMeshRayCaster` 和 "
":class:`~isaaclab.sensors.MultiMeshRayCasterCamera` 已从基于 PyTorch/USD "
"的后端迁移到原生 Warp 核函数流水线。它消除了逐步张量分配及 Torch 到 Warp 转换，提升性能，但也带来一些不兼容变化。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:1674
