":attr:`~isaaclab.sensors.RayCasterData.ray_hits_w` properties now return "
":class:`~isaaclab.utils.warp.ProxyArray` instead of ``torch.Tensor``. This "
"follows the same pattern as the general ProxyArray backend migration "
"described above."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~isaaclab.sensors.RayCasterData.pos_w` 、 "
":attr:`~isaaclab.sensors.RayCasterData.quat_w` 和 "
":attr:`~isaaclab.sensors.RayCasterData.ray_hits_w` 现在返回 "
