msgstr "**射线投射核函数签名变化**"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:1731
msgid ""
"The :func:`~isaaclab.utils.warp.kernels.raycast_dynamic_meshes_kernel` Warp "
"kernel now requires an ``env_mask`` parameter as its first argument. This is"
" a ``wp.array(dtype=wp.bool)`` that controls which environments are updated."
" The public Python wrapper "
":func:`~isaaclab.utils.warp.ops.raycast_dynamic_meshes` has been updated to "
"inject an all-True mask automatically, so code using the wrapper is "
"unaffected."
msgstr ""
"Warp 核函数 :func:`~isaaclab.utils.warp.kernels.raycast_dynamic_meshes_kernel` "
"现在要求第一个参数为 ``env_mask`` 。它是控制更新哪些环境的 ``wp.array(dtype=wp.bool)`` 。公共 Python "
"包装函数 :func:`~isaaclab.utils.warp.ops.raycast_dynamic_meshes` 已更新，会自动注入全 True"
" 掩码，因此使用包装函数的代码不受影响。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:1737
