msgstr "验证任务行为前，先迁移张量访问、索引写入、缓冲区和四元数约定。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:1790
msgid ""
"Data properties behaved like Torch tensors, quaternions used WXYZ order, and"
" one write method accepted either indices or masks."
msgstr "数据属性表现为 Torch 张量，四元数采用 WXYZ 顺序，同一个写入方法同时接受索引和掩码。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:1801
msgid ""
