#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2018
msgid "Using the Runtime Quaternion Access Detector"
msgstr "使用运行时四元数访问检测器"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2019
msgid ""
"The quaternion finder tool above covers hard-coded values in source files, "
"but it cannot see quaternions that are *read* from asset/sensor data at "
"runtime. For those, Isaac Lab ships a runtime detector hook on "
":class:`~isaaclab.utils.warp.ProxyArray` that flags every ``.torch`` access "
"on a ``wp.quatf``-typed property and points at the exact call site. Use it "
"after the source-level migration to catch the cases the finder tool can't "
"reach."
msgstr ""
"上述查找工具覆盖源文件中写死的数值，无法发现运行时从资产或传感器数据中 *读取* 的四元数。为此，Isaac Lab 在 "
":class:`~isaaclab.utils.warp.ProxyArray` 上提供运行时检测钩子，标记对 ``wp.quatf`` 类型属性的每次"
" ``.torch`` 访问，并指出确切调用位置。完成源代码迁移后，可用它查漏。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2027
msgid ""
"Enable it by setting an environment variable before launching your script:"
msgstr "启动脚本前设置环境变量，启用检测器："

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:0
#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:0
msgid "uv (Recommended)"
msgstr "uv（推荐）"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:0
#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:0
msgid "isaaclab.sh / isaaclab.bat"
msgstr "isaaclab.sh / isaaclab.bat"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2045
msgid ""
"Every read of ``.torch`` on a ``ProxyArray`` whose underlying ``wp.array`` "
"has dtype ``wp.quatf`` then emits a :class:`UserWarning` with the message:"
msgstr ""
"此后，当 ``ProxyArray`` 底层 ``wp.array`` 的 dtype 为 ``wp.quatf`` 时，每次读取 ``.torch``"
" 都会产生 :class:`UserWarning` ，消息如下："

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2055
msgid ""
"The warning's traceback points at the exact line that performed the access "
"(via ``stacklevel=2``), so you can walk through the matches in your code and"
" confirm each one uses the new ``(x, y, z, w)`` order."
msgstr ""
"警告的回溯通过 ``stacklevel=2`` 指向实际访问的代码行，可逐一检查，确认均使用新的 ``(x, y, z, w)`` 顺序。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2059
msgid "Typical workflow:"
msgstr "典型流程："

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2061
msgid "Run a representative scene or task with the env var set."
msgstr "设置环境变量，运行有代表性的场景或任务。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2062
msgid ""
"Triage every warning location — check whether the call site assumes ``(w, x,"
" y, z)`` (Lab 2.x) or ``(x, y, z, w)`` (Lab 3.x)."
msgstr ""
"逐一检查警告位置，判断调用处采用的是 ``(w, x, y, z)`` （Lab 2.x），还是 ``(x, y, z, w)`` （Lab 3.x）。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2064
msgid "Migrate the call sites that still expect the old order."
msgstr "迁移仍依赖旧顺序的调用位置。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2065
msgid ""
"Re-run with the env var still set; the warnings should be gone (or only come"
" from intentionally-handled call sites)."
msgstr "保持环境变量设置并再次运行；警告应消失，或只来自已明确处理的调用位置。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2067
msgid ""
"Unset the env var for production runs — the detector adds an ``os.environ`` "
"lookup per ``.torch`` access, which is cheap but not free."
msgstr "正式运行时取消该环境变量；检测器每次 ``.torch`` 访问都会查询 ``os.environ`` ，开销虽小，但并非为零。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2070
msgid ""
"The detector covers only ``ProxyArray.torch`` reads. Direct accesses on the "
"underlying ``wp.array`` (via ``ProxyArray.warp``) are not flagged, because "
"warp uses ``(x, y, z, w)`` natively and so a warp-side read is unaffected by"
" the convention change."
msgstr ""
"检测器只覆盖 ``ProxyArray.torch`` 读取。通过 ``ProxyArray.warp`` 直接访问底层 ``wp.array`` "
"不会被标记，因为 Warp 原生采用 ``(x, y, z, w)`` ，不受此次约定变化影响。"

