#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2211
msgid ""
"``wp.to_torch(proxy_array)`` is temporarily supported by a compatibility "
"shim. It returns the same zero-copy tensor as ``proxy_array.torch`` and "
"emits a one-time ``DeprecationWarning``. This shim exists for older "
"migration code and will be removed in a future release; prefer ``.torch`` in"
" new code."
msgstr ""
"兼容层暂时支持 ``wp.to_torch(proxy_array)`` ，返回与 ``proxy_array.torch`` "
"相同的零拷贝张量，并产生一次 ``DeprecationWarning`` 。该兼容层用于旧迁移代码，将在未来版本移除；新代码应优先用 "
"``.torch`` 。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2220
msgid "ProxyArray Interop and Temporary Compatibility"
msgstr "ProxyArray 互操作与临时兼容"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2221
msgid ""
"Asset and sensor data class properties return "
":class:`~isaaclab.utils.warp.ProxyArray`, a lightweight wrapper with "
"explicit ``.torch`` and ``.warp`` accessors:"
msgstr ""
"资产和传感器数据类的属性返回 :class:`~isaaclab.utils.warp.ProxyArray` ，它是轻量级包装，提供显式 "
"``.torch`` 和 ``.warp`` 访问器："

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2235
msgid "**Automatic interop — in many cases, no changes are needed:**"
msgstr "**自动互操作：很多情况下无需修改：**"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2237
msgid ""
"**Warp kernels:** ``ProxyArray`` implements ``__cuda_array_interface__``, so"
" it can be passed directly to ``wp.launch()`` without calling ``.warp``:"
msgstr ""
"**Warp 核函数：** ``ProxyArray`` 实现 ``__cuda_array_interface__`` ，可直接传给 "
"``wp.launch()`` ，无需调用 ``.warp`` ："

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2245
msgid ""
"**Torch functions:** ``ProxyArray`` implements ``__torch_function__``, so "
"``torch.*`` operations accept it directly. During the deprecation period "
"this emits a one-time warning, but works:"
msgstr ""
"**Torch 函数：** ``ProxyArray`` 实现 ``__torch_function__`` ，因此 ``torch.*`` "
"操作可直接接受它。弃用期间，这会产生一次警告，但仍有效："

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2254
msgid "**What to change:**"
msgstr "**需要修改的内容：**"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2256
msgid ""
"Append ``.torch`` where you need an explicit ``torch.Tensor`` (e.g., for "
"indexing, slicing, or passing to non-torch libraries)."
msgstr "需要显式 ``torch.Tensor`` 时追加 ``.torch`` ，如索引、切片或传给非 Torch 库。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2258
msgid ""
"Warp kernel calls need no changes — ``ProxyArray`` works transparently."
msgstr "Warp 核函数调用无需修改， ``ProxyArray`` 可直接使用。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2259
msgid ""
"If you need the underlying ``warp.array`` (e.g., for ``ptr``, ``strides``), "
"use ``.warp``."
msgstr "需要底层 ``warp.array`` 时，如访问 ``ptr`` 、 ``strides`` ，使用 ``.warp`` 。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2260
msgid ""
"Replace legacy ``wp.to_torch(proxy_array)`` calls with "
"``proxy_array.torch``."
msgstr "将旧 ``wp.to_torch(proxy_array)`` 调用替换为 ``proxy_array.torch`` 。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2264
msgid ""
"The ``__torch_function__`` bridge and the temporary "
"``wp.to_torch(proxy_array)`` shim will be removed in a future release. We "
"recommend migrating to explicit ``.torch`` access now."
msgstr ""
"``__torch_function__`` 桥接及临时 ``wp.to_torch(proxy_array)`` "
"兼容层将在未来版本移除，建议现在就改为显式 ``.torch`` 访问。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2267
msgid "For a complete guide, see :doc:`/source/how-to/proxy_array`."
msgstr "完整指南见 :doc:`/source/how-to/proxy_array` 。"

