#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2804
msgid "URDF Importer"
msgstr "URDF 导入器"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2805
msgid ""
"The URDF importer in Isaac Sim was rewritten to version 3.0, using the "
"``urdf-usd-converter`` library and the ``isaacsim.asset.transformer.rules`` "
"extension to produce structured USD output. The old C++ binding-based API "
"(using Kit commands ``URDFParseFile``/``URDFImportRobot`` and the ``_urdf`` "
"interface from ``acquire_urdf_interface()``) has been replaced with a new "
"Python-based pipeline."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Sim 的 URDF 导入器已重写为 3.0 版本，通过 ``urdf-usd-converter`` 库及 "
"``isaacsim.asset.transformer.rules`` 扩展生成结构化 USD 输出。旧的 C++ 绑定 API，包括 Kit 命令 "
"``URDFParseFile`` / ``URDFImportRobot`` ，以及 ``acquire_urdf_interface()`` 返回的"
" ``_urdf`` 接口，已替换为基于 Python 的新流水线。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2811
msgid ""
"The IsaacLab :class:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverter` has been updated to "
"replicate the new ``URDFImporter.import_urdf()`` pipeline, inserting "
"IsaacLab-specific post-processing (fix base, joint drives, link density) on "
"the intermediate USD stage before the asset transformer restructures the "
"output."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 的 :class:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverter` 已更新，复现新的 "
"``URDFImporter.import_urdf()`` 流水线。在资产转换器重组输出之前，它会在中间 USD 舞台中插入 Isaac Lab "
"专用后处理，包括固定基座、关节驱动和连杆密度。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2818
msgid ""
"The previous version-pinning mechanism that locked the URDF importer "
"extension to ``isaacsim.asset.importer.urdf-2.4.31`` has been removed. The "
"converter now uses whichever version of the extension is available in your "
"Isaac Sim installation."
msgstr ""
"以前将 URDF 导入器扩展锁定为 ``isaacsim.asset.importer.urdf-2.4.31`` "
"的版本固定机制已移除。转换器现在使用当前 Isaac Sim 安装中可用的扩展版本。"

