#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2841
msgid ""
"The ``merge_fixed_joints`` setting is **still supported**. It is now "
"implemented as a URDF XML pre-processing step that runs before the USD "
"conversion. Fixed joints are removed and child link elements (visual, "
"collision, inertial) are merged into the parent link with correct transform "
"composition."
msgstr ""
"``merge_fixed_joints`` **仍受支持** ，现在作为 USD 转换之前的 URDF XML "
"预处理步骤实现。固定关节被移除，子连杆的可视、碰撞及惯性元素按正确的变换组合合并到父连杆。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:2846
msgid ""
"Additionally, the "
":class:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.JointDriveCfg.NaturalFrequencyGainsCfg`"
" gains mode is **deprecated**. The ``compute_natural_stiffness`` function "
"that it depended on has been removed from the importer. If "
"``NaturalFrequencyGainsCfg`` is used, a :exc:`DeprecationWarning` is emitted"
" and joint drive gains are left at the values produced by the URDF importer."
" Use :class:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.JointDriveCfg.PDGainsCfg` "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"此外， "
":class:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.JointDriveCfg.NaturalFrequencyGainsCfg`"
" 增益模式已 **弃用** ，因为所依赖的 ``compute_natural_stiffness`` 函数已从导入器移除。使用 "
"``NaturalFrequencyGainsCfg`` 会产生 :exc:`DeprecationWarning` ，关节驱动增益保留 URDF "
"导入器生成的值。请改用 "
":class:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.JointDriveCfg.PDGainsCfg` 。"

