"from the base class is also no longer supported and will be ignored. Assets "
"will be made instanceable by default."
msgstr ""
"基类的 :attr:`~sim.converters.AssetConverterBaseCfg.make_instanceable` "
"也不再受支持，会被忽略；资产默认设为可实例化。"

