#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:3129
msgid "Benchmark Workflows"
msgstr "基准测试工作流"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:3130
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab 3.0 consolidates the per-backend environment benchmark entry "
"points and their wrapper shell runners into library-owned, backend-agnostic "
"workflows. Select the physics configuration at launch with ``physics=NAME`` "
"— the same preset mechanism used by environments — rather than choosing a "
"backend-specific script."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 3.0 将各后端专用的环境基准测试入口及其 shell 包装脚本，整合为由库提供、与后端无关的工作流。启动时通过 "
"``physics=NAME`` 选择物理配置，采用与环境相同的预设机制，无需选择后端专用脚本。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:3135
msgid "**What Changed**"
msgstr "**变化内容**"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:3137
msgid ""
"The environment benchmark entry points are now exposed through ``isaaclab "
"benchmark`` and the typed :mod:`isaaclab.benchmark` Python API:"
msgstr ""
"环境基准测试入口现在通过 ``isaaclab benchmark`` 及带类型的 :mod:`isaaclab.benchmark` Python "
"API 提供："

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:3140
msgid ""
"``isaaclab benchmark runtime`` — steps an environment with random actions "
"(no policy) and emits a ``RuntimeBundle``."
msgstr ""
"``isaaclab benchmark runtime`` ：用随机动作推进环境，不使用策略，输出 ``RuntimeBundle`` 。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:3142
msgid ""
"``isaaclab benchmark training`` — dispatches a real training run for the RL "
"library selected with ``--rl_library`` and emits a ``TrainingBundle``."
msgstr ""
"``isaaclab benchmark training`` ：根据 ``--rl_library`` 调用真实训练，输出 "
"``TrainingBundle`` 。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:3144
msgid ""
"``isaaclab benchmark startup`` — profiles the five startup phases "
"(``app_launch``, ``python_imports``, ``task_config``, ``env_creation``, "
"``first_step``) with ``cProfile`` and emits a ``StartupBundle``."
msgstr ""
"``isaaclab benchmark startup`` ：通过 ``cProfile`` 分析五个启动阶段，即 ``app_launch`` 、 "
"``python_imports`` 、 ``task_config`` 、 ``env_creation`` 、 ``first_step`` ，输出"
" ``StartupBundle`` 。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:3147
msgid ""
"``isaaclab benchmark play`` — **new in 3.0** — loads a trained checkpoint "
"and benchmarks policy inference for the RL library selected with "
"``--rl_library``, emitting a ``PlayBundle`` (inference throughput plus the "
"policy's reward, episode length, and success rate). It consumes the "
"checkpoints produced by the training workflow; 2.x had no per-backend play "
"benchmark."
msgstr ""
"``isaaclab benchmark play`` ： **3.0 新增** ，加载已训练检查点，对 ``--rl_library`` 所选 RL "
"库的策略推理进行基准测试，输出 ``PlayBundle`` ，包含推理吞吐量及策略的奖励、回合长度和成功率。它使用训练工作流产生的检查点；2.x "
"没有各后端专用的回放基准测试。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:3152
msgid ""
"The wrapper shell runners that drove these benchmarks — "
"``run_non_rl_benchmarks.sh`` and ``run_training_benchmarks.sh`` — were "
"removed as well; their behavior is now expressed directly through command "
"arguments and ``presets=`` tokens."
msgstr ""
"驱动这些基准测试的 shell 包装脚本 ``run_non_rl_benchmarks.sh`` 和 "
"``run_training_benchmarks.sh`` 也已移除，其行为现在直接通过命令参数及 ``presets=`` 选择项表达。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:3156
msgid ""
"The benchmark framework itself moved from :mod:`isaaclab.test.benchmark` to "
":mod:`isaaclab.benchmark`. The old namespace and the transitional runtime, "
"startup, training, and play scripts were removed; update imports and "
"invocations to the public module and unified command."
msgstr ""
"基准测试框架本身从 :mod:`isaaclab.test.benchmark` 移至 :mod:`isaaclab.benchmark` "
"。旧命名空间及过渡性的运行时、启动、训练和回放脚本已移除，请将导入和调用更新为公共模块及统一命令。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:3163
msgid ""
"This consolidation affects only the *environment* benchmark suite. The PhysX"
" micro-benchmarks under ``source/isaaclab_physx/benchmark/`` "
"(``benchmark_articulation.py``, ``benchmark_rigid_object.py``, and friends) "
"are unchanged — only the ``run_physx_benchmarks.sh`` wrapper that invoked "
"them was removed, so run those scripts directly. The other standalone "
"benchmark scripts under ``scripts/benchmarks/`` — "
"``benchmark_load_robot.py``, ``benchmark_view_comparison.py``, "
"``benchmark_xform_prim_view.py``, ``benchmark_lazy_export.py``, and "
"``benchmark_hydra_resolve.py`` — are independent of the unified suite and "
"likewise unaffected."
msgstr ""
"整合仅影响 *环境* 基准测试套件。 ``source/isaaclab_physx/benchmark/`` 下的 PhysX 微基准测试，如 "
"``benchmark_articulation.py`` 、 ``benchmark_rigid_object.py`` 等不变；只移除了调用它们的 "
"``run_physx_benchmarks.sh`` ，请直接运行脚本。 ``scripts/benchmarks/`` 下其他独立脚本，包括 "
"``benchmark_load_robot.py`` 、 ``benchmark_view_comparison.py`` 、 "
"``benchmark_xform_prim_view.py`` 、 ``benchmark_lazy_export.py`` 和 "
"``benchmark_hydra_resolve.py`` ，独立于统一套件，也不受影响。"

