#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:3198
msgid ""
"SKRL and Stable-Baselines3 had no dedicated benchmark script in 2.x; both "
"are now supported through the same ``--rl_library`` dispatch on ``isaaclab "
"benchmark training``. ``isaaclab benchmark play`` is likewise new in 3.0: it"
" benchmarks inference of a checkpoint trained by the training workflow for "
"any of the four RL libraries."
msgstr ""
"SKRL 和 Stable-Baselines3 在 2.x 中没有专用基准测试脚本，现在都可通过 ``isaaclab benchmark "
"training`` 的 ``--rl_library`` 分派。 ``isaaclab benchmark play`` 也是 3.0 "
"新增功能，可对四种 RL 库通过训练工作流获得的检查点进行推理基准测试。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:3203
msgid "**Running Benchmarks**"
msgstr "**运行基准测试**"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:3205
msgid ""
"The physics (and rendering) backend is selected with Hydra preset tokens — "
"``presets=``, exactly as for the training workflow. There is no "
"``--physics`` or ``--render`` flag; pass ``presets=physx``, "
"``presets=newton_mjwarp``, etc. to choose the backend."
msgstr ""
"物理及渲染后端通过 Hydra 预设选择项 ``presets=`` 选择，与训练工作流相同。没有 ``--physics`` 或 "
"``--render`` 标志，请传入 ``presets=physx`` 、 ``presets=newton_mjwarp`` 等选择后端。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:3261
msgid "**Output Format**"
msgstr "**输出格式**"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:3263
msgid ""
"The output format is controlled by ``--benchmark_formatter``, which is "
"independent of the physics backend. It defaults to ``schema`` (the typed "
"benchmark bundle) and accepts a comma-separated list to emit several formats"
" at once. Supported values are ``schema``, ``omniperf``, ``osmo``, ``json``,"
" and ``summary`` (legacy long-form aliases such as ``OmniPerfKPIFile`` are "
"still accepted)."
msgstr ""
"输出格式由 ``--benchmark_formatter`` 控制，与物理后端无关。默认为 ``schema`` "
"，即带类型的基准测试结果包；接受逗号分隔的列表，可同时输出多种格式。支持 ``schema`` 、 ``omniperf`` 、 ``osmo`` 、 "
"``json`` 和 ``summary`` ，仍接受 ``OmniPerfKPIFile`` 等旧长名称别名。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:3275
msgid "**Migration Steps**"
msgstr "**迁移步骤**"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:3277
msgid "If you have custom benchmark scripts or CI based on Isaac Lab 2.x:"
msgstr "如果有基于 Isaac Lab 2.x 的自定义基准测试脚本或 CI："

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:3279
msgid ""
"**Replace the old entry points** — swap ``benchmark_non_rl.py`` for "
"``isaaclab benchmark runtime``, ``benchmark_startup.py`` for ``isaaclab "
"benchmark startup``, and the per-library training scripts for ``isaaclab "
"benchmark training --rl_library <lib>``."
msgstr ""
"**替换旧入口** ：将 ``benchmark_non_rl.py`` 改为 ``isaaclab benchmark runtime`` ， "
"``benchmark_startup.py`` 改为 ``isaaclab benchmark startup`` ，各学习库训练脚本改为 "
"``isaaclab benchmark training --rl_library <lib>`` 。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:3283
msgid ""
"**Update benchmark imports** — replace ``isaaclab.test.benchmark`` with "
"``isaaclab.benchmark``. The old namespace is no longer available."
msgstr ""
"**更新基准测试导入** ：将 ``isaaclab.test.benchmark`` 替换为 ``isaaclab.benchmark`` "
"，旧命名空间已不可用。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:3286
msgid ""
"**Drop the wrapper runners** — ``run_non_rl_benchmarks.sh`` and "
"``run_training_benchmarks.sh`` no longer exist; express their behavior with "
"script arguments and ``presets=`` tokens. ``run_physx_benchmarks.sh`` is "
"also gone — invoke the PhysX micro-benchmarks under "
"``source/isaaclab_physx/benchmark/`` directly instead."
msgstr ""
"**移除包装脚本** ： ``run_non_rl_benchmarks.sh`` 和 ``run_training_benchmarks.sh`` "
"已不存在，请通过脚本参数及 ``presets=`` 选择项表达其行为。 ``run_physx_benchmarks.sh`` 也已移除，请直接调用 "
"``source/isaaclab_physx/benchmark/`` 下的微基准测试。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:3291
msgid ""
"**Select the backend with** ``presets=`` — replace any per-backend script "
"choice with a ``presets=`` (and, if needed, rendering) token on a single "
"unified script. Update custom benchmark configs to the ``PresetCfg`` "
"pattern."
msgstr ""
"**通过** ``presets=`` **选择后端** ：不再选择各后端脚本，而是在统一脚本上使用 ``presets=`` "
"及所需的渲染选择项。将自定义基准测试配置更新为 ``PresetCfg`` 模式。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:3295
msgid ""
"**Pick the output format with** ``--benchmark_formatter`` — default "
"``schema``; pass a comma-separated list for multiple formats."
msgstr ""
"**通过** ``--benchmark_formatter`` **选择输出格式** ：默认 ``schema`` ，多种格式可用逗号分隔列表。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:3298
msgid ""
"**Test both backends** — verify your benchmarks pass with ``presets=physx`` "
"(default) and ``presets=newton_mjwarp``."
msgstr ""
"**测试两个后端** ：确认基准测试在 ``presets=physx`` （默认）和 ``presets=newton_mjwarp`` 下均通过。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:3301
msgid ""
"For a complete guide to multi-backend support, see the \"Multi-Backend "
"Support: PresetCfg Pattern\" section above."
msgstr "多后端支持的完整指南，见上文“多后端支持：PresetCfg 模式”。"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:3306
msgid "XR Teleoperation: Isaac Capture Integration"
msgstr "XR 遥操作：Isaac Capture 集成"

#: source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0.rst:3307
