#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:4
msgid "Migration from Isaac Gym and IsaacGymEnvs"
msgstr "从 Isaac Gym 和 IsaacGymEnvs 迁移"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:10
msgid ""
"This section is the source of truth for the ``isaaclab-migrating-from-isaac-"
"gym`` agent skill (`skills/user/migrate-from-isaac-gym/ "
"<../../../skills/user/migrate-from-isaac-gym/SKILL.md>`__). When you change "
"this section, update the skill so agent guidance stays in sync. See "
":doc:`/source/developer-tools/agent_skills`."
msgstr ""
"本节是 ``isaaclab-migrating-from-isaac-gym`` 智能体技能（ `skills/user/migrate-from-"
"isaac-gym/ <../../../skills/user/migrate-from-isaac-gym/SKILL.md>`__ "
"）的权威依据。修改本节时，应同步更新技能，使智能体的指导保持一致。见 :doc:`/source/developer-"
"tools/agent_skills` 。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:16
msgid ""
"`IsaacGymEnvs`_ was a reinforcement learning framework designed for the "
"`Isaac Gym Preview Release`_. As both IsaacGymEnvs and the Isaac Gym Preview"
" Release are now deprecated, the following guide walks through the key "
"differences between IsaacGymEnvs and the current Isaac Lab APIs, as well as "
"differences between Isaac Gym Preview Release and Isaac Sim. The maintained "
":isaaclab-source:`Cartpole direct environment "
"<source/isaaclab_tasks/isaaclab_tasks/core/cartpole>` is the canonical "
"complete example for the patterns used in this guide."
msgstr ""
"`IsaacGymEnvs`_ 是为 `Isaac Gym Preview Release`_ 设计的强化学习框架。两者现已弃用，本指南介绍 "
"IsaacGymEnvs 与当前 Isaac Lab API 的主要差异，以及 Isaac Gym Preview Release 与 Isaac "
"Sim 的差异。持续维护的 :isaaclab-source:`Cartpole Direct 环境 "
"<source/isaaclab_tasks/isaaclab_tasks/core/cartpole>` 是本指南中各模式的完整参考示例。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:23
msgid "For the smoothest migration, work through this section in order:"
msgstr "为使迁移顺利，请按顺序完成本节："

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:25
msgid ""
"Translate the task and simulation configuration to Python config classes."
msgstr "将任务及仿真配置转换为 Python 配置类。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:26
msgid "Recreate the scene and actors in a direct-workflow environment."
msgstr "在 Direct 工作流环境中重新创建场景及对象。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:27
msgid ""
"Map simulation state access, paying particular attention to quaternion and "
"joint ordering."
msgstr "映射仿真状态访问，特别注意四元数及关节顺序。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:28
msgid "Port actions, resets, observations, rewards, and termination logic."
msgstr "移植动作、重置、观测、奖励和终止逻辑。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:29
msgid ""
"Smoke-test the environment before moving the training and inference "
"commands."
msgstr "先对环境做基本运行检查，再迁移训练和推理命令。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:31
msgid ""
"Use :ref:`migrating-from-isaacgymenvs-comparing-simulation` when the "
"migrated task runs but its behavior does not match Isaac Gym."
msgstr ""
"迁移后的任务能运行、但行为与 Isaac Gym 不一致时，参阅 :ref:`migrating-from-isaacgymenvs-"
"comparing-simulation` 。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:36
msgid "Task Config Setup"
msgstr "任务配置设置"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:37
msgid ""
"In IsaacGymEnvs, task config files were defined in ``.yaml`` format. With "
"Isaac Lab, configs are now specified using a specialized Python class "
":class:`~isaaclab.utils.configclass`. The "
":class:`~isaaclab.utils.configclass` module provides a wrapper on top of "
"Python's ``dataclasses`` module. Each environment should specify its own "
"config class annotated by ``@configclass`` that inherits from "
":class:`~envs.DirectRLEnvCfg`, which can include simulation parameters, "
"environment scene parameters, robot parameters, and task-specific "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"在 IsaacGymEnvs 中，任务配置文件是以 ``.yaml`` 格式定义的。在 Isaac Lab 中，现在使用专门的 Python 类 "
":class:`~isaaclab.utils.configclass` 来指定配置。 "
":class:`~isaaclab.utils.configclass` 模块提供了一个包装器，位于 Python 的 ``dataclasses`` "
"模块之上。每个环境应指定其自己的配置类，该类被 ``@configclass`` 注释，其继承自 "
":class:`~envs.DirectRLEnvCfg` ，其中可以包括仿真参数、环境场景参数、机器人参数和任务特定参数。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:43
msgid "Below is an example skeleton of a task config class:"
msgstr "以下是一个任务配置类的示例骨架: "

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:73
msgid "**Simulation Config**"
msgstr "**仿真配置**"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:75
msgid ""
"Simulation related parameters are defined as part of the "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.SimulationCfg` class, which is a "
":class:`~isaaclab.utils.configclass` module that holds simulation parameters"
" such as ``dt``, ``device``, and ``gravity``. Each task config must have a "
"variable named ``sim`` defined that holds the type "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.SimulationCfg`."
msgstr ""
"与仿真有关的参数被定义为 :class:`~isaaclab.sim.SimulationCfg` 类的一部分，这是一个 "
":class:`~isaaclab.utils.configclass` 模块，包含诸如 ``dt`` 、 ``device`` 和 "
"``gravity`` 等仿真参数。每个任务配置都必须有一个名为 ``sim`` 的变量，其类型为 "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.SimulationCfg` 。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:80
msgid ""
"In Isaac Lab, the use of ``substeps`` has been replaced by a combination of "
"the simulation ``dt`` and the ``decimation`` parameters. For example, in "
"IsaacGymEnvs, having ``dt=1/60`` and ``substeps=2`` is equivalent to taking "
"2 simulation steps with ``dt=1/120``, but running the task step at ``1/60`` "
"seconds. The ``decimation`` parameter is a task parameter that controls the "
"number of simulation steps to take for each task (or RL) step, replacing the"
" ``controlFrequencyInv`` parameter in IsaacGymEnvs. Thus, the same setup in "
"Isaac Lab will become ``dt=1/120`` and ``decimation=2``."
msgstr ""
"在 Isaac Lab 中， ``substeps`` 的使用已被仿真 ``dt`` 和 ``decimation`` 参数的组合取代。例如，在 "
"IsaacGymEnvs 中，具有 ``dt=1/60`` 和 ``substeps=2`` 等效于使用 ``dt=1/120`` 进行 2 "
"次仿真步骤，但在 ``1/60`` 秒运行任务步骤。 ``decimation`` 参数是一个任务参数，控制每个任务（或 "
"RL）步骤所需的仿真步骤数量，取代了 IsaacGymEnvs 中的 ``controlFrequencyInv`` 参数。因此，在 Isaac Lab"
" 中，相同的设置将变为 ``dt=1/120`` 和 ``decimation=2`` 。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:87
msgid ""
"In Isaac Lab, actor-specific PhysX parameters such as solver iteration "
"counts, ``contact_offset``, ``rest_offset``, and "
"``max_depenetration_velocity`` belong to the articulation or rigid-body "
"schema configuration. Scene-wide settings, including "
"``bounce_threshold_velocity``, solver-iteration clamps, and GPU buffer "
"sizes, remain on :class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxCfg`."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 中，对象专用的 PhysX 参数，如求解器迭代次数、 ``contact_offset`` 、 ``rest_offset`` 及 "
"``max_depenetration_velocity`` ，属于关节体或刚体模式配置。场景级设置，包括 "
"``bounce_threshold_velocity`` 、求解器迭代次数限制和 GPU 缓冲区大小，仍位于 "
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxCfg` 。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:92
msgid ""
"When running simulation on the GPU, buffers in PhysX require pre-allocation "
"for computing and storing information such as contacts, collisions and "
"aggregate pairs. These buffers may need to be adjusted depending on the "
"complexity of the environment, the number of expected contacts and "
"collisions, and the number of actors in the environment. The "
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxCfg` class provides access for setting "
"the GPU buffer dimensions. Use :class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxCfg` "
"directly for a PhysX-only parity port. For an environment that supports more"
" than one backend, place the backend configurations in a "
":class:`~isaaclab_tasks.utils.PresetCfg` and assign that preset to "
"``SimulationCfg.physics``."
msgstr ""
"在 GPU 上运行仿真时，PhysX "
"需要预先分配缓冲区，以计算和存储接触、碰撞及聚合对象对等信息。可能需要按环境复杂度、预计接触和碰撞数量，以及对象数量调整容量。 "
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxCfg` 提供 GPU 缓冲区尺寸设置。仅用 PhysX "
"进行行为对齐移植时，直接使用 :class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxCfg` ；环境支持多个后端时，将后端配置放入 "
":class:`~isaaclab_tasks.utils.PresetCfg` ，再赋给 ``SimulationCfg.physics`` 。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:129
msgid ""
"The maintained Cartpole configuration demonstrates the current multi-backend"
" preset pattern. The PhysX variants preserve the natural first migration "
"target from Isaac Gym, while the Newton variants can be selected after the "
"task has been validated for those solvers:"
msgstr ""
"持续维护的 Cartpole 配置展示当前多后端预设模式。PhysX 变体是从 Isaac Gym 迁移时自然的首选目标；任务在 Newton "
"求解器上通过验证后，再选择 Newton 变体："

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:153
msgid ""
"Select a validated physics preset when launching the task, for example "
"``physics=physx`` or ``physics=newton_mjwarp``. A preset name is available "
"only when the environment defines it."
msgstr ""
"启动任务时，选择已验证的物理预设，如 ``physics=physx`` 或 ``physics=newton_mjwarp`` "
"。只有环境定义了该预设名，才可使用。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:156
msgid "**Scene Config**"
msgstr "**场景配置**"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:158
msgid ""
"The :class:`~isaaclab.scene.InteractiveSceneCfg` class can be used to "
"specify parameters related to the scene, such as the number of environments "
"and the spacing between environments. Each task config must have a variable "
"named ``scene`` defined that holds the type "
":class:`~isaaclab.scene.InteractiveSceneCfg`."
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaaclab.scene.InteractiveSceneCfg` "
"类可用于指定与场景相关的参数，例如环境数量和环境之间的间距。每个任务配置必须有一个名为 ``scene`` 的变量，其类型为 "
":class:`~isaaclab.scene.InteractiveSceneCfg` 。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:172
#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:541
msgid "**Task Config**"
msgstr "**任务配置**"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:174
msgid ""
"Each environment should specify its own config class that holds task "
"specific parameters, such as the dimensions of the observation and action "
"buffers. Reward term scaling parameters can also be specified in the config "
"class."
msgstr "每个环境应指定其自己的配置类，其中包含任务特定参数，例如观测和动作缓冲区的维度。奖励项缩放参数也可以在配置类中指定。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:177
msgid "The following parameters must be set for each environment config:"
msgstr "每个环境配置必须设置以下参数: "

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:187
msgid ""
"Note that the maximum episode length parameter (now ``episode_length_s``) is"
" in seconds instead of steps as it was in IsaacGymEnvs. To convert between "
"step count to seconds, use the equation: ``episode_length_s = dt * "
"decimation * num_steps``"
msgstr ""
"请注意，最大剧集长度参数（现在为 ``episode_length_s`` ）是以秒为单位，而不是 IsaacGymEnvs "
"中的步数。要在步数和秒之间转换，请使用以下方程式:``episode_length_s = dt * decimation * num_steps``"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:193
msgid "RL Config Setup"
msgstr "RL 配置设置"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:194
msgid ""
"RL config files for the rl_games library can continue to be defined in "
"``.yaml`` files in Isaac Lab. Most of the content of the config file can be "
"copied directly from IsaacGymEnvs. Note that in Isaac Lab, we do not use "
"hydra to resolve relative paths in config files. Please replace any relative"
" paths such as ``${....device}`` with the actual values of the parameters."
msgstr ""
"rl_games 库的 RL 配置文件可以继续在 Isaac Lab 中的 ``.yaml`` 文件中定义。配置文件的大部分内容可以直接从 "
"IsaacGymEnvs 复制过来。请注意，在 Isaac Lab 中，我们不使用 hydra 来解决配置文件中的相对路径。请将任何相对路径（例如 "
"``${....device}`` ）替换为参数的实际值。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:199
msgid ""
"Additionally, the observation and action clip ranges have been moved to the "
"RL config file. For any ``clipObservations`` and ``clipActions`` parameters "
"that were defined in the IsaacGymEnvs task config file, they should be moved"
" to the RL config file in Isaac Lab."
msgstr ""
"此外，观测和动作的剪裁范围已移动到 RL 配置文件中。所有在 IsaacGymEnvs 任务配置文件中定义的 ``clipObservations`` "
"和 ``clipActions`` 参数都应在 Isaac Lab 的 RL 配置文件中进行移动。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:205
msgid "IsaacGymEnvs Task Config"
msgstr "IsaacGymEnvs 任务配置"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:205
msgid "Isaac Lab RL Config"
msgstr "Isaac Lab RL 配置"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:217
msgid "Environment Creation"
msgstr "环境创建"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:218
msgid ""
"In IsaacGymEnvs, environment creation generally included four components: "
"creating the sim object with ``create_sim()``, creating the ground plane, "
"importing the assets from MJCF or URDF files, and finally creating the "
"environments by looping through each environment and adding actors into the "
"environments."
msgstr ""
"在 IsaacGymEnvs 中，环境创建通常包括四个组件: 使用 ``create_sim()`` 创建 sim 对象，创建地面平面，从 MJCF 或"
" URDF 文件导入资产，最后通过循环遍历每个环境并将 actors 添加到环境中创建环境。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:222
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab no longer requires calling the ``create_sim()`` method to retrieve"
" the sim object. Instead, the simulation context is retrieved automatically "
"by the framework. It is also no longer required to use the ``sim`` as an "
"argument for the simulation APIs."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 不再需要调用 ``create_sim()`` 方法来检索 sim 对象。相反，仿真上下文会自动由框架检索。也不再需要将 "
"``sim`` 作为仿真 API 的参数使用。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:226
msgid ""
"Instead of implementing ``create_sim()``, declare every scene entity on the "
"direct environment's scene config. The environment constructs one "
":class:`~isaaclab.scene.InteractiveScene`, which builds those configs inside"
" one clone-plan lifecycle. Task code accesses the constructed entities "
"through ``self.scene`` and does not need to implement ``_setup_scene()``."
msgstr ""
"无需实现 ``create_sim()`` ，应在 Direct 环境的场景配置中声明所有场景实体。环境构造一个 "
":class:`~isaaclab.scene.InteractiveScene` ，在统一的克隆计划生命周期内构建这些配置。任务代码通过 "
"``self.scene`` 访问已构造的实体，无需实现 ``_setup_scene()`` 。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:250
msgid "**Ground Plane**"
msgstr "**地面**"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:252
msgid "For a simple plane, declare the ground on the scene config:"
msgstr "简单平面可直接在场景配置中声明："

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:261
msgid ""
"Use :class:`~terrains.TerrainImporterCfg` instead when the task needs "
"generated or imported terrain rather than a single plane."
msgstr "任务需要生成或导入地形，而非单一平面时，改用 :class:`~terrains.TerrainImporterCfg` 。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:265
msgid "**Actors**"
msgstr "**场景对象**"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:267
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab and Isaac Sim both use the `USD (Universal Scene Description) "
"<https://github.com/PixarAnimationStudios/OpenUSD>`_ library for describing "
"the scene. Assets defined in MJCF and URDF formats can be imported to USD "
"using importer tools described in the `Importing a New Asset <../how-"
"to/import_new_asset.html>`_ tutorial."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 和 Isaac Sim 都使用 `USD（Universal Scene Description） "
"<https://github.com/PixarAnimationStudios/OpenUSD>`_ 库来描述场景。在 MJCF 和 URDF "
"格式中定义的资产可以使用导入工具导入到 USD，导入工具的使用方法请参见 `导入新资产 <../how-"
"to/import_new_asset.html>`_ 教程。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:271
msgid ""
"Each Articulation and Rigid Body actor can also have its own config class. "
"The :class:`~isaaclab.assets.ArticulationCfg` class can be used to define "
"parameters for articulation actors, including file path, simulation "
"parameters, actuator properties, and initial states."
msgstr ""
"每个关节和刚体 actors 都可以有自己的配置类。 :class:`~isaaclab.assets.ArticulationCfg` "
"类可用于定义关节 actors 的参数，包括文件路径、仿真参数、执行器属性和初始状态。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:282
msgid ""
"Within the :class:`~assets.ArticulationCfg`, the ``spawn`` attribute can be "
"used to add the robot to the scene by specifying the path to the robot file."
" Reuse an existing asset configuration when one is available, as shown "
"above. For a custom asset, use backend-portable schema base classes from "
":mod:`isaaclab.sim.schemas` for common properties and backend-specific "
"schema classes from :mod:`isaaclab_physx.sim.schemas` or "
":mod:`isaaclab_newton.sim.schemas` only for solver-specific settings. See "
":ref:`schema-cfgs` for the current class mapping. Joint properties are "
"specified in the ``actuators`` dictionary, for example with "
":class:`~actuators.ImplicitActuatorCfg`. Joints with the same properties can"
" be grouped using regular expressions."
msgstr ""
"在 :class:`~assets.ArticulationCfg` 中，可通过 ``spawn`` "
"指定机器人文件路径，将机器人加入场景。如已有资产配置，应像上文一样复用。对于自定义资产，通用属性使用 "
":mod:`isaaclab.sim.schemas` 中可跨后端的模式基类，求解器专用设置才使用 "
