#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:348
msgid "**Cloner**"
msgstr "**克隆器**"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:350
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab provides :mod:`isaaclab.cloner` for replication during the scene "
"creation process. In IsaacGymEnvs, scenes had to be created by looping "
"through the number of environments. Within each iteration, actors were added"
" to each environment and their handles had to be cached. Isaac Lab "
"eliminates the loop by building one source environment and applying a clone "
"plan. :class:`~scene.InteractiveScene` owns this lifecycle for both Direct "
"and Manager-based environments: declare assets and sensors on the scene "
"config, then let the scene construct, clone, register, and filter them. The "
"lower-level plan API remains available for standalone tools and tests; see "
":doc:`/source/how-to/cloning`."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 提供 :mod:`isaaclab.cloner` ，在创建场景时进行复制。IsaacGymEnvs "
"需要遍历环境数量创建场景，每次循环向各环境添加对象并缓存句柄。Isaac Lab 通过构建一个源环境并应用克隆计划，省去这一循环。Direct "
"和基于管理器的环境都由 :class:`~scene.InteractiveScene` "
"管理生命周期：在场景配置中声明资产和传感器，由场景统一构造、克隆、注册并设置筛选。独立工具及测试仍可使用底层计划 API，见 "
":doc:`/source/how-to/cloning` 。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:359
msgid "Accessing States from Simulation"
msgstr "从仿真中访问状态"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:360
msgid ""
"APIs for accessing physics states in Isaac Lab require the creation of an "
":class:`~assets.Articulation` or :class:`~assets.RigidObject` object. "
"Multiple objects can be initialized for different articulations or rigid "
"bodies in the scene by defining corresponding "
":class:`~assets.ArticulationCfg` or :class:`~assets.RigidObjectCfg` config  "
"as outlined in the section above. This approach eliminates the need of "
"retrieving body handles to slice states for specific bodies in the scene."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 中访问物理状态的 API 需要创建 :class:`~assets.Articulation` 或 "
":class:`~assets.RigidObject` 对象。可以通过在上面部分概述的相应 "
":class:`~assets.ArticulationCfg` 或 :class:`~assets.RigidObjectCfg` "
"配置来初始化不同关节或刚体的多个对象，以定义场景中的关节或刚体。这种方法消除了检索体句柄以为场景中的特定体片段状态的需要。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:373
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab removes the ``acquire`` and ``refresh`` calls. Physics states are "
"read from asset data objects and written through APIs on the articulation or"
" rigid object. Tensor-valued data fields are "
":class:`~isaaclab.utils.warp.ProxyArray` objects; select the framework view "
"explicitly with ``.torch`` or ``.warp``."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 移除了 ``acquire`` 和 ``refresh`` 调用。从资产数据对象读取物理状态，通过关节体或刚性物体的 API "
"写入。张量值字段为 :class:`~isaaclab.utils.warp.ProxyArray` ，应通过 ``.torch`` 或 "
"``.warp`` 显式选择框架视图。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:377
msgid ""
"APIs provided in Isaac Lab no longer require explicit wrapping and un-"
"wrapping of underlying buffers. APIs can now work with tensors directly for "
"reading and writing data."
msgstr "在 Isaac Lab 中提供的 API 现在不再需要显式地包装和解包底层缓冲区。API 现在可以直接使用张量来读取和写入数据。"

