#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:390
msgid ""
"Note some naming differences between APIs in Isaac Gym Preview Release and "
"Isaac Lab. Most ``dof`` related APIs have been named to ``joint`` in Isaac "
"Lab. Write and target APIs make selection explicit. Use an ``_index`` method"
" with ``env_ids`` and optional ``joint_ids`` for integer selection, or the "
"corresponding ``_mask`` method for boolean selection. The leading dimension "
"of the value buffer must match the selected environments. Position and "
"velocity writes can be issued independently, which avoids reading or "
"rewriting state components that did not change."
msgstr ""
"请注意 Isaac Gym Preview Release 与 Isaac Lab 的 API 命名差异。大多数与 ``dof`` 相关的 API 在 "
"Isaac Lab 中改名为 ``joint`` 。写入及目标设置 API 明确区分选择方式：整数索引使用 ``_index`` 方法，传入 "
"``env_ids`` 及可选的 ``joint_ids`` ；布尔选择使用对应 ``_mask`` "
"方法。数值缓冲区的首维必须与选中的环境匹配。位置和速度可以分别写入，避免读取或重写未改变的状态分量。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:408
msgid "**Quaternion Convention**"
msgstr "**四元数约定**"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:412
msgid ""
"Double-check quaternion order during migration. IsaacGymEnvs and Isaac Gym "
"Preview Release tensor APIs commonly used ``xyzw`` ordering, while older "
"Isaac Lab examples and some Isaac Sim or USD APIs may use ``wxyz`` ordering."
" Current Isaac Lab task configs, task tensors, and "
":mod:`isaaclab.utils.math` utilities use ``xyzw`` ordering."
msgstr ""
"迁移时务必核对四元数顺序。IsaacGymEnvs 和 Isaac Gym Preview Release 张量 API 通常采用 ``xyzw`` "
"，旧 Isaac Lab 示例及某些 Isaac Sim 或 USD API 可能采用 ``wxyz`` 。当前 Isaac Lab "
"任务配置、任务张量及 :mod:`isaaclab.utils.math` 工具采用 ``xyzw`` 。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:416
msgid ""
"This is easy to miss because both conventions have the same shape and both "
"can contain normalized unit quaternions. A copied quaternion may therefore "
"pass shape checks while representing a different orientation."
msgstr "这一差异容易遗漏，因为两种约定的形状相同，也都可以是归一化的单位四元数。因此，复制的四元数可能通过形状检查，却表达不同朝向。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:419
msgid "Use the following identities as a quick sanity check:"
msgstr "可以通过以下单位四元数快速检查："

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:421
msgid "``xyzw`` identity: ``(0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0)``"
msgstr "``xyzw`` 单位四元数： ``(0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0)``"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:422
msgid "``wxyz`` identity: ``(1.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0)``"
msgstr "``wxyz`` 单位四元数： ``(1.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0)``"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:424
msgid ""
"When moving data across a boundary that uses a different convention, reorder"
" the components explicitly:"
msgstr "在采用不同约定的接口之间传递数据时，显式重排分量："

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:434
msgid ""
"Audit every migrated rotation in initial states, root-state resets, goal or "
"command orientations, observations, policy inputs, datasets, reward helpers,"
" camera poses, and sensor offsets. Do not copy quaternion literals from "
"IsaacGymEnvs, older Isaac Lab snippets, or USD examples without first "
"confirming the expected convention at the API boundary."
msgstr ""
"请检查迁移的所有旋转数据，包括初始状态、根状态重置、目标或命令朝向、观测、策略输入、数据集、奖励辅助函数、相机位姿和传感器偏移。复制 "
"IsaacGymEnvs、旧 Isaac Lab 或 USD 示例中的四元数常量前，先确认对应 API 边界的约定。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:440
msgid "**Articulation Joint Order**"
msgstr "**关节体关节顺序**"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:442
msgid ""
"Physics simulation in Isaac Sim and Isaac Lab assumes a breadth-first "
"ordering for the joints in a given kinematic tree. However, Isaac Gym "
"Preview Release assumed a depth-first ordering for joints in the kinematic "
"tree. This means that indexing joints based on their ordering may be "
"different in IsaacGymEnvs and Isaac Lab."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Sim 和 Isaac Lab 中的物理仿真假定给定运动树中关节的顺序是广度优先顺序。然而，Isaac Gym Preview "
"Release 中假定关节运动树中关节的顺序是深度优先顺序。这意味着根据它们的顺序对关节进行索引在 IsaacGymEnvs 和 Isaac Lab "
"中可能不同。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:447
msgid ""
"In Isaac Lab, retrieve the ordered names from ``Articulation.joint_names`` "
"and resolve task joints by name with "
":meth:`~assets.Articulation.find_joints`. Do not carry positional joint "
"indices over from IsaacGymEnvs."
msgstr ""
"在 Isaac Lab 中，通过 ``Articulation.joint_names`` 获取有序名称，通过 "
":meth:`~assets.Articulation.find_joints` 按名称查找任务关节。不要直接沿用 IsaacGymEnvs "
"的位置索引。"

#: source/migration/include/from_isaacgymenvs.rst:452
