"文件的 OmniPVD 扩展。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:92
msgid "**Parameters to Verify During Simulation Comparison**"
msgstr "**仿真对比中应核对的参数**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:94
msgid ""
"For PhysX articulations, each attribute is useful to inspect because it "
"reveals how the link or shape will actually behave in contact, under drives,"
" and at constraints. Below, each attribute is expanded with why it matters "
"for debugging and tuning simulations."
msgstr ""
"对于 PhysX "
"铰接体，每个属性都值得检查，因为它揭示了链节或形状在接触、驱动和约束下的实际行为方式。下面详细说明了每个属性及其对调试和调优仿真的重要性。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:99
msgid "**PxArticulationLink**"
msgstr "**PxArticulationLink**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:101
msgid ""
"Each link behaves like a rigid body with mass properties, damping, velocity "
"limits, and contact-resolution limits. Inspecting these helps explain "
"stability issues, jitter, and odd responses to forces."
msgstr "每个链节的行为类似于具有质量属性、阻尼、速度限制和接触解析限制的刚体。检查这些有助于解释稳定性问题、抖动和对力的异常响应。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:104
msgid "**Mass Properties**"
msgstr "**质量属性**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:106
#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:304
msgid "**Mass**"
msgstr "**质量**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:107
msgid ""
"Determines how strongly the link accelerates under forces and how it shares "
"impulses in collisions and joint constraints."
msgstr "决定链节在力作用下的加速强度，以及它在碰撞和关节约束中如何分担冲量。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:110
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Understand why a link seems \"too heavy\" (barely moves "
"when pushed) or \"too light\" (flies around from small impulses), and to "
"detect inconsistent mass distribution across a chain that can cause "
"unrealistic motion or joint stress."
msgstr ""
"*何时检查:* 理解为什么链节看起来 \"过重\" （被推动时几乎不动）或 \"过轻\" "
"（因小冲量而到处飞），以及检测链条上不一致的质量分布，这可能导致不真实的运动或关节应力。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:114
msgid "**Center of Mass (pose)**"
msgstr "**质心（位姿）**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:115
msgid "Controls where forces effectively act and how the link balances."
msgstr "控制力的有效作用位置以及链节如何平衡。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:117
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* A character or mechanism tips over unexpectedly or feels "
"unbalanced; an offset COM can cause unrealistic torque for the same contact."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 角色或机构意外倾翻或感觉不平衡；偏移的质心会导致相同接触产生不真实的扭矩。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:120
msgid "**Inertia Tensor / Inertia Scale**"
msgstr "**惯性张量 / 惯性缩放**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:121
msgid "Defines rotational resistance about each axis."
msgstr "定义关于每个轴的旋转阻力。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:123
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Links are too easy or too hard to spin relative to their "
"mass, which affects joint drive tuning and impact responses."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 相对于其质量，链节旋转过于容易或困难，这会影响关节驱动调整和冲击响应。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:126
msgid "**Damping Properties**"
msgstr "**阻尼属性**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:128
#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:326
msgid "**Linear Damping**"
msgstr "**线性阻尼**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:129
msgid ""
"Models velocity-proportional drag on translation; higher values make links "
"lose linear speed faster."
msgstr "模拟与速度成正比的平移阻力；较高的值使链节更快地失去线性速度。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:131
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Links slide too far (damping too low) or feel "
"\"underwater\" (damping too high), or when articulation energy seems to "
"vanish without obvious contact."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 链节滑动过远（阻尼过低）或感觉 \"在水下\" （阻尼过高），或者当铰接体能量似乎在没有明显接触的情况下消失时。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:134
#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:332
msgid "**Angular Damping**"
msgstr "**角阻尼**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:135
msgid ""
"Models drag on rotation; higher values make spinning links slow more "
"quickly."
msgstr "模拟旋转阻力；较高的值使旋转链节更快地减速。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:137
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Links keep spinning after impacts or motor drives (too "
"low), or joints feel \"sticky\" and fail to swing freely under gravity (too "
"high)."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 链节在冲击或电机驱动后继续旋转（过低），或者关节感觉 \"粘滞\" 且无法在重力下自由摆动（过高）。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:140
msgid "**Velocity Properties**"
msgstr "**速度属性**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:142
#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:338
msgid "**Linear Velocity**"
msgstr "**线速度**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:143
msgid "Instantaneous world-space translational velocity of the link."
msgstr "链节在世界空间中的瞬时平移速度。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:145
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Verify whether joint motors, gravity, or contacts are "
"generating expected motion, detect numerical explosions (huge spikes), and "
"correlate with CCD thresholds and max linear velocity clamping."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 验证关节电机、重力或接触是否产生预期运动，检测数值爆炸（巨大峰值），并与 CCD 阈值和最大线速度钳位关联。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:148
#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:344
msgid "**Angular Velocity**"
msgstr "**角速度**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:149
msgid "Instantaneous world-space rotational velocity."
msgstr "世界空间中的瞬时旋转速度。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:151
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Verify joint drives, impacts, or constraints are "
"producing the correct rotation; spot runaway spin that can cause instability"
" or tunneling before clamping takes effect."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 验证关节驱动、冲击或约束是否产生正确的旋转；发现失控旋转，这可能在钳位生效之前导致不稳定或穿透。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:154
#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:350
msgid "**Max Linear Velocity**"
msgstr "**最大线速度**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:155
msgid ""
"Upper bound PhysX uses to clamp linear speed before solving, intended to "
"prevent numerical issues from extremely fast motion."
msgstr "PhysX 在求解前用于钳制线速度的上限，旨在防止极快运动带来的数值问题。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:158
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Objects start tunneling or simulations explode at high "
