msgstr "*何时检查:* 关节过度伸展，穿过几何体，或在边界处突然咬合；设置错误的限制会导致弹跳和不稳定。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:224
msgid "**Drive Properties**"
msgstr "**驱动属性**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:226
msgid "**Drive target position (orientation) and target velocity**"
msgstr "**驱动目标位置（方向）和目标速度**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:227
msgid ""
