msgstr ""
"附加到链节的形状决定了碰撞表示和接触行为。即使它们在 OmniPhysics 中是内部的，它们的属性也对稳定性、接触时间和视觉对齐有很强的影响。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:249
msgid "**Collision Offsets**"
msgstr "**碰撞偏移**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:251
msgid "**Rest Offset**"
msgstr "**静止偏移**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:252
msgid ""
"Distance at which two shapes come to rest; sum of their rest offsets defines"
" the separation where they \"settle\"."
msgstr "两个形状静止时的距离；它们的静止偏移之和定义了它们 \"安定\" 的分离距离。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:254
msgid ""
