#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:269
msgid ""
"Box, sphere, capsule, convex, mesh, and the associated size parameters."
msgstr "盒子、球体、胶囊、凸面、网格以及相关的尺寸参数。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:271
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Collision footprint does not match the visual mesh—overly"
" large shapes cause premature contacts; small shapes allow visual "
"intersection and change leverage at contacts."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 碰撞轮廓与视觉网格不匹配——过大的形状会导致过早接触；小形状允许视觉相交并改变接触处的杠杆作用。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:274
msgid "**Material(s): friction, restitution, compliance**"
msgstr "**材质：摩擦、恢复、柔度**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:275
msgid "Friction coefficients and restitution define sliding and bounciness."
msgstr "摩擦系数和恢复系数定义滑动和弹性。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:277
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* An articulation foot skids too easily, sticks to the "
