"unstable or unresponsive."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 铰接体的脚太容易打滑、粘在地面上或意外反弹。错误的材质会使机构不稳定或无响应。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:280
msgid "**Shape Flags**"
msgstr "**形状标志**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:282
msgid "**Flag for simulation / query / trigger**"
msgstr "**仿真 / 查询 / 触发标志**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:283
msgid ""
"Whether the shape participates in simulation contacts, raycasts only, or "
"trigger events."
msgstr "形状是否参与仿真接触、仅光线投射或触发事件。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:285
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Contacts do not appear (shape set as query only) or "
"triggers unexpectedly create physical collisions."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 接触未出现（形状设置为仅查询）或触发器意外创建物理碰撞。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:288
msgid "**Contact density (CCD flags, if used)**"
msgstr "**接触密度（CCD 标志，如果使用）**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:289
msgid ""
"Continuous collision detection flags affecting how fast-moving links are "
"handled."
msgstr "影响快速移动链节处理方式的连续碰撞检测标志。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:291
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Fast articulation parts tunnel through thin obstacles, or"
" CCD is too aggressive and reduces performance."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 快速铰接部件穿过薄障碍物，或 CCD 过于激进并降低性能。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:295
msgid "**PxRigidDynamic**"
msgstr "**PxRigidDynamic**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:297
msgid ""
"``PxRigidDynamic`` is the core simulated rigid body type in PhysX, so "
"inspecting its attributes is crucial for understanding individual object "
"behavior, stability, and performance in the scene. Many attributes mirror "
"``PxArticulationLink``, but a rigid dynamic is not constrained by "
"articulation joints and can also be used in kinematic mode."
msgstr ""
"``PxRigidDynamic`` 是 PhysX 中的核心仿真刚体类型，因此检查其属性对于理解场景中单个对象的行为、稳定性和性能至关重要。许多属性与"
" ``PxArticulationLink`` 相似，但刚体动力学不受铰接关节约束，也可以在运动学模式下使用。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:302
msgid "**Mass and Mass-Related Properties**"
msgstr "**质量及相关属性**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:305
msgid ""
"Controls translational response to forces and impulses; for the same "
"impulse, lower mass gives higher velocity change."
msgstr "控制对力和冲量的平移响应；对于相同的冲量，较低的质量产生较高的速度变化。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:308
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* An object barely reacts to hits (mass too large) or flies"
" away from small forces (mass too small), or mass ratios between interacting"
" bodies cause overly dominant or easily bullied bodies."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 对象几乎不对撞击做出反应（质量过大）或因小力而飞走（质量过小），或交互刚体之间的质量比导致过于主导或容易被欺负的刚体。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:311
msgid "**Center of Mass (COM) pose**"
msgstr "**质心 (COM) 位姿**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:312
msgid ""
"Defines where forces effectively act and around which point the body "
"rotates."
msgstr "定义力的有效作用位置以及刚体围绕哪个点旋转。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:314
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Objects tip over unexpectedly, roll in unintuitive ways, "
"or feel \"unbalanced.\" A COM too high or off-center can cause strong "
"torques from small contacts."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 对象意外倾翻、以不直观的方式滚动或感觉 \"不平衡\" 。质心过高或偏离中心可能会导致小接触产生强扭矩。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:317
msgid "**Inertia tensor / inertia scaling**"
msgstr "**惯性张量 / 惯性缩放**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:318
msgid ""
"Determines resistance to angular acceleration around each axis for a given "
"torque."
msgstr "确定给定扭矩下围绕每个轴的角加速度阻力。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:320
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Bodies are too easy or too hard to spin (e.g., a large "
"object spinning quickly from small hits), or when anisotropic behavior is "
"needed (e.g., wheels that spin easily around one axis but resist others)."
msgstr ""
"*何时检查:* 刚体旋转过于容易或困难（例如，大物体因小撞击而快速旋转），或者当需要各向异性行为时（例如，轮子围绕一个轴容易旋转但抵抗其他轴）。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:324
msgid "**Damping and Velocity Limits**"
msgstr "**阻尼与速度限值**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:327
msgid "Adds velocity-proportional drag on translation."
msgstr "在平移上添加与速度成正比的阻力。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:329
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Bodies slide too far or for too long (damping too low) or"
" appear as if moving through thick fluid (damping too high), and when scenes"
" lose energy faster than friction alone would suggest."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 刚体滑动过远或过长时间（阻尼过低）或看起来像在浓稠液体中移动（阻尼过高），以及当场景比仅靠摩擦所暗示的更快地失去能量时。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:333
msgid "Adds drag on rotation, reducing angular velocity over time."
msgstr "增加旋转阻力，随时间降低角速度。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:335
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Spinning objects never settle or spin unrealistically "
"long (too low), or they stop rotating almost immediately after impact or "
"motor impulses (too high)."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 旋转物体从不稳定或旋转时间不切实际地长（过低），或者它们在冲击或电机冲量后几乎立即停止旋转（过高）。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:339
msgid "Current translational velocity used by the integrator and solver."
msgstr "积分器和求解器使用的当前平移速度。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:341
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Debug impulses, gravity, or applied forces to see whether"
" the body is accelerating as expected; detect spikes or non-physical jumps "
"in speed."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 调试冲量、重力或施加的力，以查看刚体是否按预期加速；检测速度中的尖峰或非物理跳跃。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:345
msgid "Current rotational speed around each axis."
msgstr "围绕每个轴的当前旋转速度。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:347
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Rotations look jittery, explode numerically, or fail to "
"respond to applied torques. High values relative to time step and object "
"scale can indicate instability."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 旋转看起来抖动、数值爆炸或未能响应施加的扭矩。相对于时间步长和对象比例的高值可能表示不稳定。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:351
msgid "Upper bound used to clamp linear velocity before solving."
msgstr "求解前用于钳制线速度的上限。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:353
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Very fast bodies cause tunneling or simulation explosions"
" (value too high), or they appear unnaturally \"speed-limited,\" especially "
"projectiles or debris in high-energy scenes (value too low)."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 非常快的刚体导致穿透或仿真爆炸（值过高），或者它们看起来被不自然地 \"限速\" ，特别是高能场景中的抛射物或碎片（值过低）。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:357
msgid "Upper bound used to clamp angular velocity."
msgstr "用于钳制角速度的上限。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:359
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Thin or small bodies spin so fast they destabilize the "
"scene (value too high), or spinning elements such as wheels, propellers, or "
"debris appear artificially capped (value too low)."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 薄或小的刚体旋转如此之快以至于它们破坏场景的稳定性（值过高），或者旋转元素如轮子、螺旋桨或碎片看起来被人为限制（值过低）。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:362
msgid "**Contact Resolution and Impulses**"
msgstr "**接触求解与冲量**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:365
msgid ""
"Limits the corrective velocity the solver may introduce in one step to "
"resolve interpenetrations."
msgstr "限制求解器在一步中可能引入的校正速度以解决互穿。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:367
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Intersecting bodies \"explode\" apart or jitter violently"
" after overlap (too high), or separate very slowly and appear stuck or "
"interpenetrated for several frames (too low)."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 相交的刚体在重叠后 \"爆炸\" 分开或剧烈抖动（过高），或者非常缓慢地分离并在几帧中看起来卡住或互穿（过低）。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:371
msgid ""
"Caps the impulse that can be applied at contacts involving this body; the "
"effective limit is the minimum between the two bodies, or the dynamic body "
"for static–dynamic contacts."
msgstr "限制涉及此刚体的接触处可以施加的冲量；有效限制是两个刚体之间的最小值，或静态-动态接触中的动态刚体。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:374
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Create softer contacts (lower limit) or very rigid, "
"almost unyielding bodies (high or default limit); objects sink into each "
"other or bounce unrealistically."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 创建更软的接触（较低限制）或非常刚性、几乎不屈服的刚体（高或默认限制）；对象相互沉入或不切实际地反弹。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:377
msgid "**Sleep and Activation Behavior**"
msgstr "**休眠与激活行为**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:379
msgid "**Sleep Threshold**"
msgstr "**休眠阈值**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:380
msgid ""
"Mass-normalized kinetic energy below which a body becomes a candidate for "
"sleeping."
msgstr "质量归一化的动能低于此值时，刚体成为休眠候选。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:382
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Bodies fall asleep too early while they should still move"
" (threshold too high) or constantly jitter and never sleep (threshold too "
"low), which can hurt performance."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 刚体在应该继续移动时过早休眠（阈值过高）或持续抖动且从不休眠（阈值过低），这可能会损害性能。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:385
msgid "**Wake Counter / isSleeping flag**"
msgstr "**唤醒计数器 / isSleeping 标志**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:386
msgid "Internal timer and state indicating whether the body is active."
msgstr "指示刚体是否活动的内部计时器和状态。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:388
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Bodies refuse to wake up on interactions or wake too "
"easily. Bad sleep behavior can make scenes feel \"dead\" or too noisy."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 刚体在交互时拒绝唤醒或过于容易唤醒。不良的休眠行为会使场景感觉 \"死气沉沉\" 或过于嘈杂。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:391
msgid "**Kinematic Mode and Locking**"
msgstr "**运动学模式与锁定**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:393
msgid "**Kinematic Flag (PxRigidBodyFlag::eKINEMATIC)**"
msgstr "**运动学标志 (PxRigidBodyFlag::eKINEMATIC)**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:394
msgid ""
"When set, the body is moved by ``setKinematicTarget`` and ignores forces and"
" gravity, while still affecting dynamic bodies it touches."
msgstr "设置后，刚体通过 ``setKinematicTarget`` 移动并忽略力和重力，同时仍然影响其接触的动态刚体。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:397
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Objects appear to have infinite mass (pushing others but "
"not reacting) or ignore gravity and impulses. Mismatched expectations here "
"commonly cause odd behavior in characters, moving platforms, or doors."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 对象似乎具有无限质量（推动其他对象但不做出反应）或忽略重力和冲量。这里的不匹配预期通常会导致角色、移动平台或门的奇怪行为。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:401
msgid "**Rigid Dynamic Lock Flags (PxRigidDynamicLockFlag)**"
msgstr "**刚体动力学锁定标志 (PxRigidDynamicLockFlag)**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:402
msgid ""
"Per-axis linear and angular DOF locks, effectively constraining motion "
"without a joint."
msgstr "每轴线性和角度自由度锁定，有效地在没有关节的情况下约束运动。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:404
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Bodies unexpectedly move in constrained directions (lock "
"not set) or fail to move/rotate where they should (lock set by mistake), "
"especially for 2D-style movement or simple constrained mechanisms."
msgstr ""
"*何时检查:* 刚体意外地在受约束方向上移动（未设置锁定）或在应该移动/旋转的地方无法移动（错误设置锁定），特别是对于 2D "
"风格的移动或简单的受约束机构。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:408
msgid "**Disable Gravity (PxActorFlag::eDISABLE_GRAVITY)**"
msgstr "**禁用重力 (PxActorFlag::eDISABLE_GRAVITY)**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:409
msgid "Toggles whether the body is affected by scene gravity."
msgstr "切换刚体是否受场景重力影响。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:411
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Objects float in mid-air or drop unexpectedly. A common "
"source of confusion in mixed setups with some gravity-less bodies."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 对象漂浮在半空中或意外掉落。在某些无重力刚体的混合设置中，这是常见的困惑来源。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:414
msgid "**Forces and Solver Overrides**"
msgstr "**力与求解器覆盖设置**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:416
msgid "**Applied force and torque (accumulated per step)**"
msgstr "**施加的力和扭矩（每步累积）**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:417
msgid "Net forces/torques that will be integrated into velocity."
msgstr "将被积分到速度中的净力/扭矩。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:419
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Debug gameplay forces (thrusters, character pushes, "
"explosions) to see if the expected input is actually reaching the body."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 调试游戏力（推进器、角色推动、爆炸）以查看预期输入是否实际到达刚体。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:422
msgid ""
"**Per-body solver iteration counts (minPositionIters, minVelocityIters)**"
msgstr "**每刚体求解器迭代计数 (minPositionIters, minVelocityIters)**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:423
msgid ""
"Overrides for how many solver iterations this body gets in constraints and "
"contacts."
msgstr "此刚体在约束和接触中获得多少求解器迭代的覆盖。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:425
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Certain bodies (e.g., characters, stacked crates, fragile"
" structures) need higher stability or more accurate stacking. Low iterations"
" can cause jitter and penetration; too high wastes performance."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 某些刚体（例如，角色、堆叠的箱子、脆弱的结构）需要更高的稳定性或更准确的堆叠。低迭代可能导致抖动和穿透；过高会浪费性能。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:429
msgid "**Shape-Related Aspects**"
msgstr "**形状相关属性**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:431
msgid ""
"While not properties of ``PxRigidDynamic`` itself, the shapes attached to it"
" heavily influence behavior."
msgstr "虽然不是 ``PxRigidDynamic`` 本身的属性，但附加到它的形状会严重影响行为。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:433
msgid "**Attached Shapes' Rest and Contact Offsets**"
msgstr "**附加形状的静止和接触偏移**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:434
msgid ""
"Control predictive contact generation and visual separation as described "
