msgstr "如前所述，控制预测性接触生成和视觉分离。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:436
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* A dynamic body seems to collide too early/late or appears"
" to float above surfaces or intersect them visually."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 动态刚体似乎碰撞过早/过晚或看起来漂浮在表面上方或与它们视觉相交。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:439
msgid "**Attached Materials (friction, restitution)**"
msgstr "**附加材质（摩擦、恢复）**"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:440
msgid "Define sliding and bounciness for this body's contacts."
msgstr "定义此刚体接触的滑动和弹性。"

#: source/migration/include/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:442
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Rigid dynamics skid, stick, or bounce in unexpected ways."
" Often the \"behavior issue\" is material configuration rather than mass or "
