"``PhysxDeformableCollisionPropertiesCfg``"

#: source/migration/include/deformables.rst:110
msgid ""
"Set them on the mesh spawner instead, using "
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.sim.schemas.PhysxCollisionCfg`: "
"``collision_props=[PhysxCollisionCfg(rest_offset=0.0005, "
"contact_offset=0.005)]``. PhysX reads collision offsets off the collider, "
"which for a deformable is its simulation mesh, so authoring them on the body"
" prim never reached the solver."
msgstr ""
"请改为通过 :class:`~isaaclab_physx.sim.schemas.PhysxCollisionCfg` 在网格生成器上设置： "
"``collision_props=[PhysxCollisionCfg(rest_offset=0.0005, "
"contact_offset=0.005)]`` 。PhysX 从碰撞体读取碰撞偏移，对于可变形物体，碰撞体就是其仿真网格，因此写在刚体 prim "
"上的值从未传到求解器。"

#: source/migration/include/deformables.rst:116
msgid ""
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.sim.PhysxDeformableBodyPropertiesCfg` also gained "
"fields from the new schema. See the class reference and the `PhysX "
"deformable schema`_ for the current list."
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.sim.PhysxDeformableBodyPropertiesCfg` "
"也增加了新模式中的字段。当前列表见类参考及 `PhysX 可变形模式 <PhysX deformable schema_>`_ 。"

#: source/migration/include/deformables.rst:120
msgid "Behavior Changes"
msgstr "行为变化"

#: source/migration/include/deformables.rst:121
msgid ""
"Kinematic targets are volume-only. Calling "
":meth:`~isaaclab.assets.DeformableObject.write_nodal_kinematic_target_to_sim_index`"
" on a surface deformable raises a ``ValueError``."
msgstr ""
"运动学目标仅适用于体积可变形物体。对表面可变形物体调用 "
":meth:`~isaaclab.assets.DeformableObject.write_nodal_kinematic_target_to_sim_index`"
" 会抛出 ``ValueError`` 。"

#: source/migration/include/deformables.rst:124
msgid ""
"``collision_pair_update_frequency`` and ``collision_iteration_multiplier`` "
"have no effect on volume deformables."
msgstr ""
"``collision_pair_update_frequency`` 和 ``collision_iteration_multiplier`` "
"对体积可变形物体无效。"

#: source/migration/include/deformables.rst:126
msgid ""
"The PhysX view behind a deformable changed from ``physx.SoftBodyView`` to "
"``physx.DeformableBodyView``, and ``root_physx_view`` is deprecated in favor"
" of ``root_view``."
msgstr ""
"可变形物体底层 PhysX 视图从 ``physx.SoftBodyView`` 改为 ``physx.DeformableBodyView`` ， "
"``root_physx_view`` 已弃用，改用 ``root_view`` 。"

